Dialogue: 0.0:00:41.73.0:00:46.85.Default..0.0.0..THE HOBBIT\N- The Battle of the Five Armies -
Dialogue: 0.0:01:01.54.0:01:05.39.Default..0.0.0..I warned.\NI warned you what would happen to deal with dwarves.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:05.50.0:01:06.65.Default..0.0.0..We forced.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:06.73.0:01:07.95.Default..0.0.0..They woke the dragon.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:08.07.0:01:10.27.Default..0.0.0..Brought the apocalypse upon us.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:10.38.0:01:11.47.Default..0.0.0..Fast.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:11.59.0:01:14.11.Default..0.0.0..Do it fast.\NFaster.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:14.22.0:01:16.09.Default..0.0.0..I'm trying to get out of here asap\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:16.24.0:01:19.23.Default..0.0.0..Watch out. Quick. bring\Nelse.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:19.31.0:01:19.99.Default..0.0.0..No sir.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:20.10.0:01:22.99.Default..0.0.0..- I will save the city.\N- Whether it is lost.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:23.10.0:01:25.22.Default..0.0.0..Salven gold.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:25.33.0:01:28.28.Default..0.0.0..Let's go.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:29.51.0:01:30.86.Default..0.0.0..Soldiers.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:43.48.0:01:44.96.Default..0.0.0..No time.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:45.08.0:01:46.07.Default..0.0.0..We must leave.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:46.17.0:01:46.86.Default..0.0.0..Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:46.98.0:01:48.42.Default..0.0.0..Come brother. fast. fast\N. Now.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:48.57.0:01:49.98.Default..0.0.0..I'm fine.\Ncan walk.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:50.09.0:01:51.85.Default..0.0.0..We're not leaving.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:51.93.0:01:53.67.Default..0.0.0..Not without our father.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:53.78.0:01:56.48.Default..0.0.0..If you stay. your\Nsisters die.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:56.56.0:01:58.22.Default..0.0.0..Is what your father\Nwant?
Dialogue: 0.0:01:59.97.0:02:01.81.Default..0.0.0..Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:01.96.0:02:03.37.Default..0.0.0..Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0.0:02:14.10.0:02:16.95.Default..0.0.0..Us out.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:17.10.0:02:18.41.Default..0.0.0..Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:18.48.0:02:20.53.Default..0.0.0..Rapid must leave.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:20.68.0:02:21.40.Default..0.0.0..Corran.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:21.52.0:02:22.56.Default..0.0.0..Fast Kili.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:23.62.0:02:24.95.Default..0.0.0..Not stop.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:34.50.0:02:35.93.Default..0.0.0..Already saw.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:00.01.0:03:02.03.Default..0.0.0..Come on.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:11.61.0:03:12.55.Default..0.0.0..Fast.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:12.66.0:03:15.04.Default..0.0.0..Faster. faster.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:17.72.0:03:21.29.Default..0.0.0..If I could take more than\Nthese people here.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:21.43.0:03:22.98.Default..0.0.0..- But I will not.\N- Dwalin
Dialogue: 0.0:03:23.10.0:03:24.54.Default..0.0.0..I'll think about.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:30.92.0:03:32.72.Default..0.0.0..Watch out.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:39.17.0:03:39.89.Default..0.0.0..Remen. remen.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:40.00.0:03:40.82.Default..0.0.0..Remen.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:40.97.0:03:43.09.Default..0.0.0..Remen. faster.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:43.24.0:03:45.25.Default..0.0.0..My gold. my gold.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:45.25.0:03:46.71.Default..0.0.0..Here there is too much weight.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:46.83.0:03:48.01.Default..0.0.0..We throw something.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:48.52.0:03:50.39.Default..0.0.0..Sorry.
Dialogue: 0.0:03:57.89.0:03:59.97.Default..0.0.0..Remen. remen.
Dialogue: 0.0:04:02.35.0:04:03.93.Default..0.0.0..Corran.
Dialogue: 0.0:05:15.36.0:05:17.69.Default..0.0.0..Poor...
Dialogue: 0.0:06:20.00.0:06:20.87.Default..0.0.0..Toma.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:38.16.0:06:39.53.Default..0.0.0..Dad.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:39.64.0:06:41.23.Default..0.0.0..Dad.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:45.05.0:06:47.23.Default..0.0.0..Met him.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:47.34.0:06:47.97.Default..0.0.0..No.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:48.23.0:06:50.44.Default..0.0.0..I gave. gave in\Nthe body. seriously.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:50.56.0:06:52.58.Default..0.0.0..Their arrows will not atraviezan\Nhis breastplate.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:52.69.0:06:54.56.Default..0.0.0..I fear nothing will.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:09.93.0:07:11.92.Default..0.0.0..He.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:14.84.0:07:15.85.Default..0.0.0..Leave him.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:15.93.0:07:17.34.Default..0.0.0..We can not go back.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:17.45.0:07:18.74.Default..0.0.0..Bain.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:41.48.0:07:42.42.Default..0.0.0..Dad.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:43.72.0:07:45.81.Default..0.0.0..Bain. What are you doing?\NWhy do not you leave?
Dialogue: 0.0:07:45.90.0:07:47.04.Default..0.0.0..You ought to leave here.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:47.14.0:07:48.66.Default..0.0.0..- Just came to support you.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:48.77.0:07:50.51.Default..0.0.0..Nothing can stop it.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:50.62.0:07:51.90.Default..0.0.0..This may.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:55.00.0:07:57.98.Default..0.0.0..Bain. now go.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:58.06.0:08:00.22.Default..0.0.0..You have to leave now.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:02.21.0:08:03.84.Default..0.0.0..Back.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:09.84.0:08:11.94.Default..0.0.0..- Bain.\N- Ahh.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:22.24.0:08:24.86.Default..0.0.0..Wait. wait. wait.\NStop. stop.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:32.81.0:08:38.01.Default..0.0.0..Who are you do you dare to face\N?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:41.85.0:08:45.36.Default..0.0.0..Now that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:46.27.0:08:52.13.Default..0.0.0..What were you going to do now.\Narcher?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:52.24.0:08:55.37.Default..0.0.0..All you have left.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:55.45.0:08:58.98.Default..0.0.0..No one will come to help.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:59.09.0:09:02.40.Default..0.0.0..Now is when.\NMove on. Now.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:02.48.0:09:04.57.Default..0.0.0..Turn to open water.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:07.17.0:09:10.58.Default..0.0.0..Is that your son?
Dialogue: 0.0:09:12.06.0:09:16.16.Default..0.0.0..You can not save him from the fire.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:16.31.0:09:20.73.Default..0.0.0..'s Going to burn.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:38.59.0:09:40.67.Default..0.0.0..Do not move child.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:41.20.0:09:42.33.Default..0.0.0..Stay well.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:43.23.0:09:45.48.Default..0.0.0..Look.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:45.55.0:09:51.77.Default..0.0.0..Slag.\NHow do you think now challenge me?
Dialogue: 0.0:09:55.38.0:09:59.23.Default..0.0.0..Now. I have nothing left.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:59.37.0:10:03.37.Default..0.0.0..Only your death.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:05.04.0:10:10.38.Default..0.0.0..Bain. look at me.\NJust watch me.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:14.85.0:10:17.09.Default..0.0.0..A little to your left.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:18.53.0:10:19.86.Default..0.0.0..That is.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:35.89.0:10:38.08.Default..0.0.0..Bain. hold on.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:19.28.0:11:20.25.Default..0.0.0..What was that?
Dialogue: 0.0:11:21.09.0:11:23.33.Default..0.0.0..- What happened?\N- I saw him. fell.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:26.47.0:11:28.48.Default..0.0.0..'s Dead.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:32.33.0:11:34.05.Default..0.0.0..Smaug is dead.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:35.01.0:11:37.74.Default..0.0.0..By my beard.\Nbelieve is true.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:37.81.0:11:40.27.Default..0.0.0..Look there.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:41.35.0:11:42.42.Default..0.0.0..The Raven.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:42.53.0:11:45.63.Default..0.0.0..'re Busting the mountain.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:45.74.0:11:47.53.Default..0.0.0..True.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:47.68.0:11:49.13.Default..0.0.0..Voice are run.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:49.24.0:11:52.89.Default..0.0.0..Pretty soon. everyone\Nof Middle Earth will know.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:53.00.0:11:55.12.Default..0.0.0..The dragon is dead.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:05.77.0:12:11.35.Default..0.0.0..The Battle of Five Armies
Dialogue: 0.0:12:26.54.0:12:27.93.Default..0.0.0..You.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:32.99.0:12:35.27.Default..0.0.0..You are not alone.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:35.35.0:12:36.96.Default..0.0.0..My dragnir.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:37.08.0:12:39.02.Default..0.0.0..My lealidon.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:39.13.0:12:40.83.Default..0.0.0..Intulitun.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:54.70.0:12:57.30.Default..0.0.0..Somebody help me.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:57.40.0:12:59.03.Default..0.0.0..Help me.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:02.34.0:13:03.17.Default..0.0.0..Here.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:03.32.0:13:04.40.Default..0.0.0..Here.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:08.59.0:13:11.35.Default..0.0.0..Dad.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:18.00.0:13:21.10.Default..0.0.0..Ahh. why me?
Dialogue: 0.0:13:29.06.0:13:30.44.Default..0.0.0..Tauriel.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:31.72.0:13:34.52.Default..0.0.0..Kili. come on.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:34.67.0:13:35.71.Default..0.0.0..Now we go.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:36.92.0:13:39.02.Default..0.0.0..That's your family.\NYou must go.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:40.20.0:13:41.97.Default..0.0.0..Come with me.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:43.17.0:13:46.05.Default..0.0.0..I know how I feel.\NI do not fear that.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:46.13.0:13:47.75.Default..0.0.0..You make me feel alive.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:47.86.0:13:49.52.Default..0.0.0..- I'm sorry.\N- Tauriel.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:50.64.0:13:52.51.Default..0.0.0..Anclalme.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:56.07.0:13:58.52.Default..0.0.0..I do not know what that means\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:59.71.0:14:01.83.Default..0.0.0..I think so.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:08.59.0:14:10.53.Default..0.0.0..My legolas lord.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:13.81.0:14:16.19.Default..0.0.0..Say goodbye dwarf.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:17.84.0:14:20.18.Default..0.0.0..You need elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:46.53.0:14:48.08.Default..0.0.0..Keep it.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:49.00.0:14:50.40.Default..0.0.0..As promise.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:17.55.0:15:20.68.Default..0.0.0..These are dry.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:20.75.0:15:22.12.Default..0.0.0..- Hey.\N- Watch Out.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:22.24.0:15:23.53.Default..0.0.0..Give me one of those.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:23.65.0:15:25.41.Default..0.0.0..Going to die with this cold.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:25.48.0:15:27.14.Default..0.0.0..Ayy. get yourself another.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:27.29.0:15:29.45.Default..0.0.0..No're in charge now Alfrid L.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:29.56.0:15:30.65.Default..0.0.0..That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:30.76.0:15:33.98.Default..0.0.0..The absence of the governor assumed power\Npassed to substitute...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:34.09.0:15:36.18.Default..0.0.0..... which in this case is\Nmy official capacity.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:36.32.0:15:37.39.Default..0.0.0..Now give me this blanket.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:39.17.0:15:40.99.Default..0.0.0..Alternate Governor?
Dialogue: 0.0:15:41.06.0:15:42.36.Default..0.0.0..Not make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:42.43.0:15:44.64.Default..0.0.0..'re A rat despicable
Dialogue: 0.0:15:44.79.0:15:47.42.Default..0.0.0..rather be dead than follow someone like you.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:47.54.0:15:49.91.Default..0.0.0..Maybe he can fix.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:53.23.0:15:56.58.Default..0.0.0..I would not put\Nagainst your people Alfrid.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:56.65.0:15:57.94.Default..0.0.0..Not now.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:02.97.0:16:04.06.Default..0.0.0..Here you are!
Dialogue: 0.0:16:04.17.0:16:05.40.Default..0.0.0..Come over.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:12.42.0:16:15.13.Default..0.0.0..It was Bard. the\Nkilled the dragon.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:15.23.0:16:16.92.Default..0.0.0..I saw him when he passed\Neverything.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:17.00.0:16:18.58.Default..0.0.0..He knocked the beast.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:18.70.0:16:20.96.Default..0.0.0..Killed a black arrow
Dialogue: 0.0:16:33.16.0:16:35.08.Default..0.0.0..Honor everyone.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:35.20.0:16:37.03.Default..0.0.0..Al dragon hunter.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:37.18.0:16:41.00.Default..0.0.0..Honor everyone.\NThe King Bard.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:42.14.0:16:44.52.Default..0.0.0..I have told many friends\Ntimes.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:44.66.0:16:47.43.Default..0.0.0..This is a man of noble breed.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:47.84.0:16:49.12.Default..0.0.0..A true leader.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:49.24.0:16:50.18.Default..0.0.0..Not call me that.
Dialogue: 0.0:16:50.29.0:16:52.99.Default..0.0.0..I'm not governor of this city
Dialogue: 0.0:16:53.07.0:16:55.10.Default..0.0.0..Where is he?
Dialogue: 0.0:16:55.70.0:16:57.18.Default..0.0.0..Where is the governor?
Dialogue: 0.0:16:57.29.0:17:00.53.Default..0.0.0..Far for\NAndui with all our gold.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:00.61.0:17:01.55.Default..0.0.0..I do not doubt
Dialogue: 0.0:17:01.63.0:17:03.14.Default..0.0.0..You know that.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:03.25.0:17:05.99.Default..0.0.0..You helped to empty coffers.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:06.10.0:17:09.63.Default..0.0.0..No. I try to prevent it.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:11.70.0:17:13.58.Default..0.0.0..I begged. I pleaded.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:15.60.0:17:18.05.Default..0.0.0..I told the governor.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:18.16.0:17:19.64.Default..0.0.0..No.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:22.67.0:17:23.89.Default..0.0.0..After what...
Dialogue: 0.0:17:25.82.0:17:29.06.Default..0.0.0..What one takes into account\Nchildren?
Dialogue: 0.0:17:40.28.0:17:41.84.Default..0.0.0..Enough.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:41.98.0:17:44.25.Default..0.0.0..Release him. I release him.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:46.13.0:17:48.90.Default..0.0.0..Look around you.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:50.85.0:17:53.03.Default..0.0.0..Have not had enough death?
Dialogue: 0.0:17:55.78.0:17:57.26.Default..0.0.0..Here comes the winter.
Dialogue: 0.0:17:58.39.0:18:00.11.Default..0.0.0..We take care of our own.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:00.22.0:18:03.22.Default..0.0.0..From the sick and helpless.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:03.29.0:18:06.71.Default..0.0.0..Those who are well.\Nattend to the wounded.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:06.82.0:18:08.52.Default..0.0.0..And having\Nforces. follow me.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:08.67.0:18:10.68.Default..0.0.0..We must save what is left.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:10.76.0:18:12.71.Default..0.0.0..And then.\NWhat will we do then?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:15.31.0:18:18.19.Default..0.0.0..Seeking refuge.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:03.55.0:19:05.88.Default..0.0.0..Hello?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:06.82.0:19:09.17.Default..0.0.0..Bombur?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:09.28.0:19:11.22.Default..0.0.0..Bifur?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:11.34.0:19:12.96.Default..0.0.0..Can anybody hear me?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:20.87.0:19:21.73.Default..0.0.0..Wait.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:23.66.0:19:25.21.Default..0.0.0..- Is Bilbo!\N- It's alive!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:25.33.0:19:27.49.Default..0.0.0..Wait. high.\Nwait.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:27.60.0:19:29.71.Default..0.0.0..There you go faster.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:29.85.0:19:31.55.Default..0.0.0..They have to go around the world.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:31.66.0:19:33.15.Default..0.0.0..So newcomers?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:33.22.0:19:35.05.Default..0.0.0..Try to talk to him\Nbut not heard.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:35.13.0:19:36.91.Default..0.0.0..- What are you talking about son?\N- De Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:37.02.0:19:37.68.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:37.76.0:19:40.03.Default..0.0.0..Thorin takes days there.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:40.15.0:19:42.25.Default..0.0.0..Not want to sleep. eat nothing\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:42.37.0:19:44.77.Default..0.0.0..Now is not the same\Nall.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:45.09.0:19:48.62.Default..0.0.0..Is this. this palace.\NI think there's a disorder.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:48.73.0:19:49.53.Default..0.0.0..Disorder?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:49.64.0:19:52.67.Default..0.0.0..What kind of disorder?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:54.44.0:19:55.26.Default..0.0.0..Fili.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:55.38.0:19:56.51.Default..0.0.0..Fili.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:56.64.0:19:58.31.Default..0.0.0..Fili.
Dialogue: 0.0:20:28.85.0:20:30.55.Default..0.0.0..Gold
Dialogue: 0.0:20:31.74.0:20:34.80.Default..0.0.0..Oro immeasurable.
Dialogue: 0.0:20:35.82.0:20:41.22.Default..0.0.0..Beyond\Nsadness and pain.
Dialogue: 0.0:20:47.65.0:20:54.99.Default..0.0.0..Behold. the great treasure\Nancestral Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.0:20:57.70.0:20:59.45.Default..0.0.0..Ya.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:01.75.0:21:06.03.Default..0.0.0..Welcome. nephews\Nones.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:08.60.0:21:11.87.Default..0.0.0..Al incredible Kingdom
Dialogue: 0.0:21:12.90.0:21:14.45.Default..0.0.0..In Erebor.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:17.27.0:21:19.00.Default..0.0.0..Balin.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:32.94.0:21:34.40.Default..0.0.0..Does it signal?
Dialogue: 0.0:21:35.49.0:21:36.51.Default..0.0.0..Nothing here
Dialogue: 0.0:21:36.62.0:21:37.37.Default..0.0.0..Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:37.44.0:21:39.55.Default..0.0.0..This gem could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:39.62.0:21:42.53.Default..0.0.0..The ark is\Nstone in these halls. Seek it.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:43.15.0:21:44.23.Default..0.0.0..Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:44.31.0:21:45.14.Default..0.0.0..Everyone.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:46.34.0:21:48.50.Default..0.0.0..No rest until it appears.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:19.41.0:22:23.76.Default..0.0.0..Almost'm finishing let you take it.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:24.74.0:22:28.80.Default..0.0.0..I just want to see suffer\Na Oakenshield.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:29.96.0:22:32.76.Default..0.0.0..Destroy.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:32.88.0:22:36.55.Default..0.0.0..Verlo corrupt his heart.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:36.67.0:22:39.61.Default..0.0.0..And again wolf.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:13.11.0:23:14.74.Default..0.0.0..Just give the...
Dialogue: 0.0:23:16.05.0:23:17.55.Default..0.0.0..The road is long enough?
Dialogue: 0.0:23:17.66.0:23:18.56.Default..0.0.0..Where do they go?
Dialogue: 0.0:23:20.30.0:23:22.73.Default..0.0.0..There is only one option.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:26.20.0:23:27.74.Default..0.0.0..Mountain.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:27.86.0:23:30.46.Default..0.0.0..You are a genius sir.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:30.57.0:23:33.06.Default..0.0.0..We can take refuge inside the mountain.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:33.17.0:23:34.80.Default..0.0.0..Maybe stinks dragon.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:34.91.0:23:36.61.Default..0.0.0..The women will be cleaned.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:36.72.0:23:38.16.Default..0.0.0..And be sure.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:38.27.0:23:40.83.Default..0.0.0..-
Dialogue: 0.0:23:40.95.0:23:42.63.Default..0.0.0..-
Dialogue: 0.0:23:42.74.0:23:45.04.Default..0.0.0..Also be gold.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:47.00.0:23:49.45.Default..0.0.0..That gold is cursed.\NUnderstand.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:49.59.0:23:52.00.Default..0.0.0..Take only what was promised.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:52.11.0:23:54.04.Default..0.0.0..As required to retake our lives.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:55.06.0:23:57.80.Default..0.0.0..Hey. take your part.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:57.91.0:24:01.73.Default..0.0.0..The news of the death of Smaug will spread.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:01.80.0:24:03.53.Default..0.0.0..Right.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:05.34.0:24:08.43.Default..0.0.0..Now others will go to the mountain.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:10.03.0:24:11.73.Default..0.0.0..With its wealth
Dialogue: 0.0:24:12.47.0:24:13.58.Default..0.0.0..and position.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:13.66.0:24:15.16.Default..0.0.0..What do you know?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:15.80.0:24:17.45.Default..0.0.0..Nothing really
Dialogue: 0.0:24:18.90.0:24:20.91.Default..0.0.0..That's what I fear\Nto come.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:32.99.0:24:35.80.Default..0.0.0..Forest Elves!
Dialogue: 0.0:24:37.75.0:24:39.70.Default..0.0.0..The king's son and the elf...
Dialogue: 0.0:24:40.25.0:24:42.99.Default..0.0.0..... tracked us to the Town Lake.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:48.79.0:24:51.46.Default..0.0.0..What killed them?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:51.75.0:24:53.36.Default..0.0.0..Fled...
Dialogue: 0.0:24:53.47.0:24:55.15.Default..0.0.0..... crying like cowards.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:55.20.0:24:57.34.Default..0.0.0..Tonto! They will return...
Dialogue: 0.0:24:57.46.0:25:01.33.Default..0.0.0..... with an army of elves!
Dialogue: 0.0:25:03.69.0:25:06.84.Default..0.0.0..Go to Gundabad.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:07.88.0:25:11.34.Default..0.0.0..To move the legions.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:16.07.0:25:17.44.Default..0.0.0..Elves!
Dialogue: 0.0:25:18.04.0:25:19.83.Default..0.0.0..Men!
Dialogue: 0.0:25:19.94.0:25:21.35.Default..0.0.0..Dwarves!
Dialogue: 0.0:25:21.77.0:25:26.81.Default..0.0.0..The mountain will be his grave.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:30.81.0:25:32.58.Default..0.0.0..On the way you see anything?
Dialogue: 0.0:25:32.69.0:25:35.60.Default..0.0.0..The orc chasing the\NLake City. who already is.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:35.71.0:25:38.88.Default..0.0.0..Bolgo. Beast\NAzog the Defiler.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:39.34.0:25:42.41.Default..0.0.0..A herd of Wargs\Ntarget outside Esgarot.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:42.53.0:25:43.92.Default..0.0.0..Were north.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:44.00.0:25:48.68.Default..0.0.0..These orcs are different. They have a brand\NI had not seen in a while.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:48.76.0:25:50.85.Default..0.0.0..The mark of a Gundabad.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:50.96.0:25:52.08.Default..0.0.0..A Gundabad?
Dialogue: 0.0:25:52.19.0:25:55.43.Default..0.0.0..A strength of the edge\NOrcs of the Misty Mountains.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:55.55.0:25:56.66.Default..0.0.0..Legolas...
Dialogue: 0.0:25:58.87.0:26:01.46.Default..0.0.0..should return immediately.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:01.57.0:26:03.49.Default..0.0.0..Come Tauril.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:03.60.0:26:04.48.Default..0.0.0..Wait...
Dialogue: 0.0:26:04.59.0:26:08.16.Default..0.0.0..Tauriel is banished.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:08.30.0:26:09.31.Default..0.0.0..I do not think so.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:10.16.0:26:16.63.Default..0.0.0..Can you tell my father what if there is no room for Tauriel\N. there is no room for me?
Dialogue: 0.0:26:18.26.0:26:19.14.Default..0.0.0..Legolas.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:19.25.0:26:22.42.Default..0.0.0..I ordered for him directly?
Dialogue: 0.0:26:22.57.0:26:24.33.Default..0.0.0..Right.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:26.86.0:26:29.67.Default..0.0.0..I go north.\NAre you coming with me?
Dialogue: 0.0:26:29.79.0:26:31.28.Default..0.0.0..Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0.0:26:31.42.0:26:32.69.Default..0.0.0..A Gundabad.
Dialogue: 0.0:27:23.56.0:27:26.68.Default..0.0.0..Spells will not save you. old man.
Dialogue: 0.0:27:51.57.0:27:54.88.Default..0.0.0..These are the demons of my master...
Dialogue: 0.0:27:55.00.0:27:56.95.Default..0.0.0..Die already. sorcerer!
Dialogue: 0.0:28:15.14.0:28:22.40.Default..0.0.0..Three rings for the Elven\Nkings under the sky...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:22.72.0:28:28.37.Default..0.0.0..Feel for\Ndwarf lords in their halls of stone...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:28.37.0:28:33.83.Default..0.0.0..It was. for mortal men doomed to die\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:28:57.27.0:28:59.97.Default..0.0.0..You can not fight with shadows.
Dialogue: 0.0:29:00.24.0:29:02.93.Default..0.0.0..Whether you are receding.
Dialogue: 0.0:29:03.04.0:29:05.49.Default..0.0.0..One light...
Dialogue: 0.0:29:05.64.0:29:08.18.Default..0.0.0..... in the dark.
Dialogue: 0.0:29:08.95.0:29:11.97.Default..0.0.0..I have not come alone.
Dialogue: 0.0:29:22.57.0:29:26.16.Default..0.0.0..He needs help my lady?
Dialogue: 0.0:29:30.01.0:29:33.54.Default..0.0.0..You should never rise again.
Dialogue: 0.0:29:34.32.0:29:36.44.Default..0.0.0..Back.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:00.01.0:30:02.07.Default..0.0.0..The...
Dialogue: 0.0:30:03.08.0:30:05.79.Default..0.0.0..back.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:21.02.0:30:23.90.Default..0.0.0..He is here. .
Dialogue: 0.0:30:24.04.0:30:28.19.Default..0.0.0..Yes They have returned.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:39.39.0:30:42.04.Default..0.0.0..Gandalf upload here.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:42.15.0:30:46.23.Default..0.0.0..Is weak. I take it.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:48.07.0:30:49.88.Default..0.0.0..Run. They have to leave.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:51.36.0:30:55.23.Default..0.0.0..Come with me. my lady\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:31:03.71.0:31:05.40.Default..0.0.0..Largo.
Dialogue: 0.0:31:43.27.0:31:46.04.Default..0.0.0..Has begun.
Dialogue: 0.0:31:46.26.0:31:48.66.Default..0.0.0..The East fall.
Dialogue: 0.0:31:48.77.0:31:53.70.Default..0.0.0..And the Kingdom of Ang...
Dialogue: 0.0:31:54.37.0:31:58.78.Default..0.0.0..The elf was finished.
Dialogue: 0.0:31:58.90.0:32:01.68.Default..0.0.0..The age of orcs has arrived.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:09.46.0:32:15.43.Default..0.0.0..Here you have no power.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:15.58.0:32:17.67.Default..0.0.0..... Of Mordor.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:19.39.0:32:24.32.Default..0.0.0..You have no name.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:24.81.0:32:27.10.Default..0.0.0..Ni face.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:27.25.0:32:31.17.Default..0.0.0..Ni shape.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:34.50.0:32:38.61.Default..0.0.0..Enters back into the void.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:38.68.0:32:42.50.Default..0.0.0..By...
Dialogue: 0.0:33:00.53.0:33:02.08.Default..0.0.0..We cheated.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:03.53.0:33:06.86.Default..0.0.0..The spirit of Sauron endured.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:07.01.0:33:09.47.Default..0.0.0..And I was already expelled.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:09.59.0:33:12.14.Default..0.0.0..Va to flee eastward.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:14.16.0:33:16.05.Default..0.0.0..Should be noted Gondor.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:16.39.0:33:19.05.Default..0.0.0..Let stand guard on the walls of Mordor.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:19.45.0:33:22.25.Default..0.0.0..No.\Ntakes good care of Lady Galadriel.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:22.39.0:33:24.44.Default..0.0.0..Has spent too much power.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:24.78.0:33:26.69.Default..0.0.0..His strength fades.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:26.80.0:33:28.57.Default..0.0.0..Take her...
Dialogue: 0.0:33:28.69.0:33:31.62.Default..0.0.0..My Lord Saruman.\Nhe should be prosecuted...
Dialogue: 0.0:33:31.73.0:33:33.89.Default..0.0.0..... and destroyed a\Naltogether.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:34.16.0:33:36.01.Default..0.0.0..If it has the ring of power.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:36.13.0:33:40.29.Default..0.0.0..Sauron. can never have the domain\NMiddle Earth again.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:41.51.0:33:43.46.Default..0.0.0..Get out and
Dialogue: 0.0:33:43.57.0:33:47.49.Default..0.0.0..I'll see him in person.
Dialogue: 0.0:33:57.00.0:33:58.69.Default..0.0.0..I need a horse
Dialogue: 0.0:33:58.80.0:34:02.16.Default..0.0.0..Gandalf. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0.0:34:02.26.0:34:05.21.Default..0.0.0..A warning Erebor.\Nhas no idea what will come.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:05.32.0:34:06.91.Default..0.0.0..I saw with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:06.98.0:34:09.67.Default..0.0.0..Row after row\Nthousands of orcs.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:09.78.0:34:12.64.Default..0.0.0..Call our friends. birds and beasts
Dialogue: 0.0:34:12.76.0:34:15.50.Default..0.0.0..battle in the mountains.\Nis about to begin.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:17.02.0:34:20.36.Default..0.0.0..Are here in these halls
Dialogue: 0.0:34:20.47.0:34:23.48.Default..0.0.0..I know.\NWe searched and searched.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:23.60.0:34:24.63.Default..0.0.0..Not enough.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:24.82.0:34:27.63.Default..0.0.0..Thorin. look\Nfind the stone.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:27.74.0:34:30.01.Default..0.0.0..However...\Ndo not find it.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:32.59.0:34:37.42.Default..0.0.0..Now loyalty\Ndoubt someone here?
Dialogue: 0.0:34:45.61.0:34:50.89.Default..0.0.0..The stone ark.\Nis the legacy of our people.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:51.05.0:34:54.74.Default..0.0.0..Y is the jewel of the king.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:54.85.0:34:57.48.Default..0.0.0..Do not consider me king?
Dialogue: 0.0:35:08.50.0:35:09.92.Default..0.0.0..Listen.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:13.32.0:35:18.96.Default..0.0.0..If someone finds the stone and hide from me.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:20.08.0:35:23.21.Default..0.0.0..'ll Get revenge.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:37.72.0:35:39.87.Default..0.0.0..Evil dragon.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:40.74.0:35:42.35.Default..0.0.0..Already had seen.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:43.72.0:35:46.06.Default..0.0.0..That look
Dialogue: 0.0:35:46.20.0:35:48.50.Default..0.0.0..terrible longing
Dialogue: 0.0:35:49.70.0:35:52.98.Default..0.0.0..is a ferocious and jealous love\NBilbo.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:54.32.0:35:57.64.Default..0.0.0..That went crazy grandfather.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:58.33.0:36:04.05.Default..0.0.0..Balin look. if Thorin had\Njewel.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:05.17.0:36:07.33.Default..0.0.0..Yes. if you find the stone.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:08.60.0:36:11.12.Default..0.0.0..Would really help?
Dialogue: 0.0:36:13.29.0:36:17.62.Default..0.0.0..That gem. crowns it all.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:18.70.0:36:21.51.Default..0.0.0..Is the summit of this\Nwealth.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:21.62.0:36:24.82.Default..0.0.0..It gives power. one who possesses
Dialogue: 0.0:36:24.90.0:36:27.04.Default..0.0.0..augentaría his insanity.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:27.98.0:36:30.21.Default..0.0.0..No. son.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:32.08.0:36:34.31.Default..0.0.0..Fear that could worsen.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:36.48.0:36:41.26.Default..0.0.0..Perhaps better. than follow\Nlost.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:54.87.0:36:56.20.Default..0.0.0..What is that?
Dialogue: 0.0:36:57.68.0:36:58.95.Default..0.0.0..In your hand.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:59.74.0:37:00.28.Default..0.0.0..None.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:00.57.0:37:01.90.Default..0.0.0..Ensename
Dialogue: 0.0:37:03.49.0:37:04.54.Default..0.0.0..Es
Dialogue: 0.0:37:11.35.0:37:14.26.Default..0.0.0..The take the floor in the garden\NPeron.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:18.67.0:37:20.20.Default..0.0.0..You brought from there?
Dialogue: 0.0:37:20.71.0:37:23.95.Default..0.0.0..'ll Plant it in my garden\N. when I return.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:26.25.0:37:30.21.Default..0.0.0..You take little\Nback to the region.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:30.36.0:37:36.94.Default..0.0.0..No. One day grow. and when I see\N'll think...
Dialogue: 0.0:37:37.91.0:37:44.25.Default..0.0.0..... I remember what happened. The good. the bad\N. and how lucky I was to return.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:53.51.0:37:54.67.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:55.57.0:38:01.72.Default..0.0.0..Thorin. survivors of the city.\Nare invading all Deil.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:03.06.0:38:04.46.Default..0.0.0..There are thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:05.30.0:38:08.25.Default..0.0.0..Call them at the entrance\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:09.41.0:38:11.89.Default..0.0.0..At the entrance. now.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:43.20.0:38:44.85.Default..0.0.0..Come. No stop.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:44.92.0:38:45.88.Default..0.0.0..Lord.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:46.92.0:38:48.15.Default..0.0.0..Lord.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:49.09.0:38:50.17.Default..0.0.0..Above.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:59.10.0:39:01.69.Default..0.0.0..Look sir. The\Nbraziers are on.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:01.81.0:39:06.73.Default..0.0.0..So the company of Thorin Oakenshield\Nsurvived.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:06.84.0:39:08.29.Default..0.0.0..Did he survive?
Dialogue: 0.0:39:09.09.0:39:12.03.Default..0.0.0..So there are a lot\Ndwarf there with all the gold?
Dialogue: 0.0:39:12.66.0:39:14.60.Default..0.0.0..You do not distress Alfrid
Dialogue: 0.0:39:14.75.0:39:17.30.Default..0.0.0..There is enough gold in the mountains for everyone.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:17.41.0:39:19.29.Default..0.0.0..Camp here today.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:19.41.0:39:21.33.Default..0.0.0..Take refuge where they can.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:21.40.0:39:22.95.Default..0.0.0..Blaze fires.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:24.22.0:39:27.74.Default..0.0.0..Alfrid. you have the\NNight Watch.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:45.53.0:39:48.66.Default..0.0.0..Have to have something to dawn.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:49.55.0:39:51.48.Default..0.0.0..This mountain cost us a lot
Dialogue: 0.0:39:51.59.0:39:53.14.Default..0.0.0..will not remove\Nus again.
Dialogue: 0.0:39:53.25.0:39:56.08.Default..0.0.0..The city people have nothing
Dialogue: 0.0:39:56.20.0:39:59.97.Default..0.0.0..We searched necessity have lost their entire life.
Dialogue: 0.0:40:00.08.0:40:03.43.Default..0.0.0..Not you come to me\Nwhat they lost them.
Dialogue: 0.0:40:03.50.0:40:06.96.Default..0.0.0..I know very well their difficulties
Dialogue: 0.0:40:07.07.0:40:11.50.Default..0.0.0..Those who survived the fire dragon\Nshould celebrate.
Dialogue: 0.0:40:12.66.0:40:15.58.Default..0.0.0..Have much to be thankful for.
Dialogue: 0.0:40:19.67.0:40:22.41.Default..0.0.0..More rocks
Dialogue: 0.0:40:24.83.0:40:26.51.Default..0.0.0..bring more rocks at the entrance
Dialogue: 0.0:40:29.37.0:40:31.32.Default..0.0.0..'ll try more
Dialogue: 0.0:40:47.91.0:40:51.48.Default..0.0.0..Y\Nchildren die of hunger. We need food.
Dialogue: 0.0:40:51.63.0:40:53.17.Default..0.0.0..There have for three days.
Dialogue: 0.0:40:53.25.0:40:54.97.Default..0.0.0..Bard. will not be enough.
Dialogue: 0.0:40:55.09.0:40:56.49.Default..0.0.0..Do what you can.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:01.72.0:41:04.56.Default..0.0.0..Children.\Nand women wounded first.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:04.67.0:41:05.32.Default..0.0.0..Yes
Dialogue: 0.0:41:06.90.0:41:07.99.Default..0.0.0..Good day Alfrid.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:08.56.0:41:10.06.Default..0.0.0..Any news of the guard?
Dialogue: 0.0:41:10.16.0:41:13.12.Default..0.0.0..All quiet sir.\Nnot much to report.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:13.23.0:41:14.97.Default..0.0.0..Nothing wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:22.07.0:41:25.58.Default..0.0.0..Except a troop of elves. obviously.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:58.59.0:41:59.97.Default..0.0.0..My lord Thranduil.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:00.08.0:42:03.56.Default..0.0.0..- No I thought I'd see here.\N- I heard you need help.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:25.50.0:42:26.36.Default..0.0.0..Here!
Dialogue: 0.0:42:32.14.0:42:33.61.Default..0.0.0..Saved us.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:33.76.0:42:35.92.Default..0.0.0..I am indebted to you
Dialogue: 0.0:42:36.03.0:42:37.82.Default..0.0.0..Your gratitude is very rushed.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:37.93.0:42:39.72.Default..0.0.0..I have not come in\Nbehalf of you.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:39.83.0:42:43.10.Default..0.0.0..I have come to claim\Nsomething of mine.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:49.92.0:42:54.13.Default..0.0.0..There are gems in the mountains\NI want.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:54.24.0:42:57.98.Default..0.0.0..White Gems.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:58.06.0:43:00.94.Default..0.0.0..White gems of Esgaroth.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:02.89.0:43:06.84.Default..0.0.0..Know an elf lord\Npay much money for these gems.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:11.23.0:43:12.64.Default..0.0.0..Wait
Dialogue: 0.0:43:12.79.0:43:14.16.Default..0.0.0..Please higher
Dialogue: 0.0:43:16.53.0:43:19.44.Default..0.0.0..Will you go to war for\Na handful of gems?
Dialogue: 0.0:43:19.55.0:43:23.26.Default..0.0.0..The relics of my people\Nnot leave easily.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:23.37.0:43:25.10.Default..0.0.0..Are allies in this
Dialogue: 0.0:43:26.18.0:43:29.82.Default..0.0.0..My village is also entitled\Nto the riches of that mountain.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:31.09.0:43:32.78.Default..0.0.0..Let me talk with Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:32.86.0:43:36.04.Default..0.0.0..Will you try to reason with dwarf?
Dialogue: 0.0:43:36.10.0:43:39.15.Default..0.0.0..If avoid war. yes.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:40.20.0:43:41.64.Default..0.0.0..Can assemble...
Dialogue: 0.0:43:44.06.0:43:45.05.Default..0.0.0..Come on.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:07.86.0:44:10.71.Default..0.0.0..Greetings Thorin. son of Thrain
Dialogue: 0.0:44:10.82.0:44:13.55.Default..0.0.0..We are happy to see them with life in such a situation.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:13.67.0:44:17.81.Default..0.0.0..Why have come to the entrance\Nking under the mountain armed for war?
Dialogue: 0.0:44:17.92.0:44:21.59.Default..0.0.0..Why the king under the mountain\Nhas been held there?
Dialogue: 0.0:44:21.70.0:44:23.68.Default..0.0.0..How else do you a thief?
Dialogue: 0.0:44:24.33.0:44:27.77.Default..0.0.0..Maybe because I'm suspecting\Nrob me.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:28.24.0:44:30.08.Default..0.0.0..My lord
Dialogue: 0.0:44:30.19.0:44:32.74.Default..0.0.0..We're not here to steal.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:32.85.0:44:35.23.Default..0.0.0..But if to negotiate fairly.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:35.34.0:44:37.46.Default..0.0.0..Do not you talk to me?
Dialogue: 0.0:45:11.82.0:45:13.96.Default..0.0.0..Speak Now.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:15.04.0:45:19.68.Default..0.0.0..On behalf of the inhabitants of the city.\Nrequest that lives up to its promise.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:19.79.0:45:23.53.Default..0.0.0..One of the treasure\Nso can regain their lives.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:23.64.0:45:26.66.Default..0.0.0..I will not negotiate with any man.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:26.77.0:45:30.14.Default..0.0.0..With an armed host\Nfront of my door.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:30.26.0:45:33.81.Default..0.0.0..And that attack this mountain guest\Nif we do not reach an agreement.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:34.36.0:45:37.24.Default..0.0.0..Your threats do not convince me.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:38.75.0:45:41.05.Default..0.0.0..What about your\Nconsciousness?
Dialogue: 0.0:45:41.16.0:45:44.04.Default..0.0.0..She tells him\Nour cause is just?
Dialogue: 0.0:45:45.27.0:45:48.61.Default..0.0.0..My people offered their support.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:49.51.0:45:54.03.Default..0.0.0..And in exchange for that we only sent\Npure death and desolation.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:54.10.0:45:57.60.Default..0.0.0..But men in your city\Noffered his help for the promise of a reward.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:57.68.0:45:59.12.Default..0.0.0..There was a negotiation.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:59.20.0:46:00.02.Default..0.0.0..How you say?
Dialogue: 0.0:46:00.13.0:46:03.16.Default..0.0.0..What choice was\Nus to change our stronghold...
Dialogue: 0.0:46:03.27.0:46:04.50.Default..0.0.0..... for blankets and food.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:04.59.0:46:07.68.Default..0.0.0..Rescue our future.\Nnegotiating our freedom.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:08.76.0:46:11.05.Default..0.0.0..You think it's a fair deal?
Dialogue: 0.0:46:12.24.0:46:14.30.Default..0.0.0..Tell me.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:14.41.0:46:16.90.Default..0.0.0..Bard dragon hunter.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:18.06.0:46:20.71.Default..0.0.0..Why would honor such terms?
Dialogue: 0.0:46:22.18.0:46:25.13.Default..0.0.0..Because pcs.\Ngave us his word.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:28.83.0:46:30.99.Default..0.0.0..Already  means nothing?
Dialogue: 0.0:46:45.29.0:46:46.73.Default..0.0.0..Go away.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:47.50.0:46:49.63.Default..0.0.0..Or you will fall our arrows.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:06.72.0:47:09.14.Default..0.0.0..What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0.0:47:10.59.0:47:13.61.Default..0.0.0..You do not have to go to war\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:14.56.0:47:16.13.Default..0.0.0..This does not concern you.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:16.24.0:47:20.92.Default..0.0.0..Excuse me. If not\Nwill notice there is a troop of elves out there.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:20.99.0:47:23.48.Default..0.0.0..Not to mention hundreds of angry fishermen.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:24.10.0:47:26.27.Default..0.0.0..They beat us in number.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:28.17.0:47:30.22.Default..0.0.0..That will not last.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:31.92.0:47:32.56.Default..0.0.0..What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0.0:47:32.67.0:47:34.75.Default..0.0.0..Means Mr. Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:36.12.0:47:40.33.Default..0.0.0..That should never underestimate the dwarves.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:43.58.0:47:45.77.Default..0.0.0..'ve Taken Erebor.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:46.82.0:47:49.62.Default..0.0.0..Now to defend.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:07.28.0:48:09.29.Default..0.0.0..No we're getting nothing.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:10.41.0:48:12.38.Default..0.0.0..A shame.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:12.49.0:48:14.29.Default..0.0.0..Equal you tried.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:14.40.0:48:15.80.Default..0.0.0..'s What I do not understand
Dialogue: 0.0:48:16.89.0:48:18.00.Default..0.0.0..Why?
Dialogue: 0.0:48:18.52.0:48:20.52.Default..0.0.0..Why risk\Na war?
Dialogue: 0.0:48:33.57.0:48:35.71.Default..0.0.0..It is useless to reason with them.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:35.83.0:48:38.82.Default..0.0.0..Actually there is only one thing.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:42.57.0:48:44.47.Default..0.0.0..'ll Attack at sunrise.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:47.08.0:48:48.55.Default..0.0.0..Are you with us?
Dialogue: 0.0:49:25.17.0:49:26.47.Default..0.0.0..Mr. Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:26.59.0:49:27.81.Default..0.0.0..Come over.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:44.59.0:49:46.54.Default..0.0.0..You'll need this.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:47.33.0:49:49.24.Default..0.0.0..Póntelo.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:54.50.0:49:57.42.Default..0.0.0..This vest is made of plated steel.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:58.71.0:50:00.89.Default..0.0.0..Mithril.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:01.43.0:50:03.69.Default..0.0.0..Was it created by my ancestors.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:05.65.0:50:08.60.Default..0.0.0..No sword pass through.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:19.58.0:50:21.05.Default..0.0.0..I look absurd.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:21.13.0:50:22.76.Default..0.0.0..I am not a warrior.\NI am a Hobbit.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:22.88.0:50:24.82.Default..0.0.0..Is a gift.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:26.22.0:50:28.45.Default..0.0.0..Sign of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:31.51.0:50:33.46.Default..0.0.0..'s Hard to find friends.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:35.57.0:50:36.92.Default..0.0.0..I was blinded.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:37.03.0:50:38.98.Default..0.0.0..But now I see everything.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:39.98.0:50:41.90.Default..0.0.0..He suffered a betrayal.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:43.27.0:50:44.56.Default..0.0.0..How to betrayal?
Dialogue: 0.0:50:45.50.0:50:47.21.Default..0.0.0..The stone ark.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:55.77.0:50:58.25.Default..0.0.0..He took one of them.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:05.13.0:51:08.41.Default..0.0.0..One must be very wrong.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:09.50.0:51:10.43.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:11.19.0:51:13.71.Default..0.0.0..The task is completed.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:13.82.0:51:15.00.Default..0.0.0..Win the mountain.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:15.11.0:51:16.06.Default..0.0.0..Is not that enough?
Dialogue: 0.0:51:16.17.0:51:18.80.Default..0.0.0..I was betrayed by my people.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:19.59.0:51:23.60.Default..0.0.0..Your you made a promise to the people of the city.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:23.75.0:51:27.10.Default..0.0.0..That really treasure worth more than your honor?
Dialogue: 0.0:51:27.21.0:51:28.58.Default..0.0.0..Our honor.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:28.69.0:51:30.59.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.\NI was also there. I gave my word.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:30.71.0:51:32.50.Default..0.0.0..For that I value
Dialogue: 0.0:51:32.58.0:51:35.92.Default..0.0.0..nobleman was doing. But the treasure\Nof this mountain is not theirs...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:36.03.0:51:38.02.Default..0.0.0..... the inhabitants of\NLake City.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:38.16.0:51:39.96.Default..0.0.0..This gold...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:43.09.0:51:45.57.Default..0.0.0..... is ours.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:46.52.0:51:49.08.Default..0.0.0..And ours alone.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:52.57.0:51:54.51.Default..0.0.0..For my life.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:54.77.0:52:02.18.Default..0.0.0..That never share any of this treasure.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:03.73.0:52:10.92.Default..0.0.0..Not a single currency.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:31.17.0:52:32.93.Default..0.0.0..Gondabad.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:35.89.0:52:37.87.Default..0.0.0..What lies beyond?
Dialogue: 0.0:52:37.97.0:52:39.45.Default..0.0.0..An old enemy.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:39.56.0:52:42.59.Default..0.0.0..The ancient kingdom of Angamar.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:45.14.0:52:48.07.Default..0.0.0..This strength was its bastion.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:48.15.0:52:50.79.Default..0.0.0..Is where he had his large armories.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:50.90.0:52:53.24.Default..0.0.0..Y forged his weapons of war.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:54.73.0:52:56.59.Default..0.0.0..A light and movement.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:58.65.0:53:01.34.Default..0.0.0..Wait the veil of the night.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:02.38.0:53:04.38.Default..0.0.0..Tauriel is a lethal place.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:04.52.0:53:08.71.Default..0.0.0..At one time our people\Nmade war on the land.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:17.99.0:53:20.61.Default..0.0.0..My mother died there.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:21.91.0:53:24.43.Default..0.0.0..My father never talks about it.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:25.55.0:53:27.93.Default..0.0.0..No one grave.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:28.90.0:53:30.93.Default..0.0.0..Ni monument.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:41.94.0:53:44.31.Default..0.0.0..Let me pass.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:45.47.0:53:46.65.Default..0.0.0..Step Open.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:04.00.0:54:06.15.Default..0.0.0..Wow. you
Dialogue: 0.0:54:06.31.0:54:07.75.Default..0.0.0... The pointy hat
Dialogue: 0.0:54:08.73.0:54:10.94.Default..0.0.0..Yes. you.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:11.08.0:54:15.01.Default..0.0.0..Not want bums. beggars and vagabonds\Nhere.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:15.12.0:54:17.18.Default..0.0.0..There are enough problems with people like that.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:18.39.0:54:20.97.Default..0.0.0..Now elder.\Nout of here.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:21.08.0:54:22.67.Default..0.0.0..Who's in charge here?
Dialogue: 0.0:54:22.78.0:54:24.62.Default..0.0.0..Who cares?
Dialogue: 0.0:54:28.33.0:54:31.79.Default..0.0.0..Should put aside their resentment\Ndwarfs.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:31.86.0:54:33.59.Default..0.0.0..The war is coming.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:33.70.0:54:36.76.Default..0.0.0..The marshes of Dolguldur\Nwere emptied.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:36.87.0:54:39.53.Default..0.0.0..Everyone is in mortal danger.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:39.64.0:54:41.27.Default..0.0.0..What you talking about?
Dialogue: 0.0:54:41.38.0:54:43.68.Default..0.0.0..It shows you know nothing\Nwizards.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:44.12.0:54:47.81.Default..0.0.0..Son as a winter lightning\Na Vendabal approaching...
Dialogue: 0.0:54:47.89.0:54:51.42.Default..0.0.0..... far far\Nnoise and alarm.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:51.65.0:54:56.61.Default..0.0.0..But sometimes a\Nstorm is just that.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:56.72.0:54:58.59.Default..0.0.0..Will not be this time.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:58.70.0:55:01.05.Default..0.0.0..Troops are advancing orcs.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:01.16.0:55:03.90.Default..0.0.0..Are warriors were forged for war.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:04.01.0:55:06.07.Default..0.0.0..Our enemy has invoked\Nfull force.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:06.14.0:55:07.98.Default..0.0.0..Why show your\Nfire now?
Dialogue: 0.0:55:07.99.0:55:09.33.Default..0.0.0..Because we force.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:09.48.0:55:14.22.Default..0.0.0..What we force when the company\NThorin came to reclaim his old home.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:14.34.0:55:17.61.Default..0.0.0..Dwarves never had to reach Erebor.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:17.73.0:55:20.31.Default..0.0.0..Azog the Defiler was sent to kill them.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:20.42.0:55:24.02.Default..0.0.0..His love. want to control\Nmountain.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:24.10.0:55:26.47.Default..0.0.0..Not for the treasure it holds.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:26.58.0:55:29.85.Default..0.0.0..But where is its strategic position.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:30.00.0:55:35.29.Default..0.0.0..This is the passage to reclaim the land of Angmar\Nin the north.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:35.40.0:55:38.37.Default..0.0.0..If that lethal kingdom\Nreaching up again.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:39.28.0:55:45.83.Default..0.0.0..Rivendell. Laurien. the county. even\NGondor same fall.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:45.83.0:55:48.91.Default..0.0.0..These troops than\Ntalk Mithrandril.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:49.05.0:55:51.07.Default..0.0.0..Where are they?
Dialogue: 0.0:55:55.07.0:55:58.71.Default..0.0.0..Our army will be in place at dawn.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:59.10.0:56:01.75.Default..0.0.0..The attack is sudden and fast!
Dialogue: 0.0:56:01.86.0:56:03.89.Default..0.0.0..Fools!
Dialogue: 0.0:56:04.04.0:56:08.25.Default..0.0.0..Have forgotten what lives beneath these lands\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:56:10.50.0:56:15.10.Default..0.0.0..Have forgotten the great cometierra.
Dialogue: 0.0:56:25.06.0:56:29.03.Default..0.0.0..If we are to enter.\Nshould go now.
Dialogue: 0.0:56:40.23.0:56:42.39.Default..0.0.0..They move in packs.
Dialogue: 0.0:56:44.54.0:56:47.32.Default..0.0.0..These bats are bred for a purpose.
Dialogue: 0.0:56:47.43.0:56:48.31.Default..0.0.0..For what?
Dialogue: 0.0:56:50.12.0:56:51.81.Default..0.0.0..For war.
Dialogue: 0.0:57:32.93.0:57:35.24.Default..0.0.0..We must warn others.
Dialogue: 0.0:57:35.39.0:57:37.79.Default..0.0.0..Maybe it's too late. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0.0:57:52.35.0:57:56.06.Default..0.0.0..Since when my advice is so depreciated\N?
Dialogue: 0.0:57:56.17.0:57:57.66.Default..0.0.0..What do you think trying to do?
Dialogue: 0.0:57:57.78.0:58:00.40.Default..0.0.0..I think you try to save your fellow dwarves\N.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:00.51.0:58:02.92.Default..0.0.0..Y\NI admire your loyalty towards them.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:03.07.0:58:05.98.Default..0.0.0..But only achieved dissuade my intention.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:06.55.0:58:09.44.Default..0.0.0..Your you started this.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:09.59.0:58:12.87.Default..0.0.0..'ll Have to help if I end now.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:12.97.0:58:14.71.Default..0.0.0..The mysteries are in place?
Dialogue: 0.0:58:15.14.0:58:16.83.Default..0.0.0..Yes my lord.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:16.86.0:58:18.00.Default..0.0.0..Da order.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:18.11.0:58:22.13.Default..0.0.0..If something moves in\Nthat mountain. kill him.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:24.81.0:58:27.22.Default..0.0.0..End of dwarves came.
Dialogue: 0.0:58:53.90.0:58:55.59.Default..0.0.0..You Bard. are you\Nagree with this?
Dialogue: 0.0:58:58.22.0:59:00.41.Default..0.0.0..Gold\Nis so important to you?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:00.53.0:59:03.62.Default..0.0.0..What would you buy with the death of dwarves?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:03.73.0:59:05.46.Default..0.0.0..He will not come to that.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:05.58.0:59:07.11.Default..0.0.0..Is a battle that can not be won.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:07.23.0:59:08.60.Default..0.0.0..That did not stop.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:08.67.0:59:11.54.Default..0.0.0..If you believe that the dwarf\Nsurrender. forget...
Dialogue: 0.0:59:11.62.0:59:13.52.Default..0.0.0..... will fight with everything\Ndefending his own.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:13.64.0:59:15.41.Default..0.0.0..Bilbo Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:16.39.0:59:19.99.Default..0.0.0..If I'm not mistaken. this is\Nthe small keys theft...
Dialogue: 0.0:59:20.11.0:59:22.95.Default..0.0.0..... My dungeon in\Nnoses of my guards.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:25.59.0:59:27.28.Default..0.0.0..Yes
Dialogue: 0.0:59:28.65.0:59:29.64.Default..0.0.0..An apology.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:31.15.0:59:35.30.Default..0.0.0..I came... to give them this.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:39.69.0:59:42.57.Default..0.0.0..The heart of the mountains.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:43.90.0:59:45.42.Default..0.0.0..The jewel of the king.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:46.33.0:59:49.10.Default..0.0.0..Has immense value.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:51.63.0:59:53.17.Default..0.0.0..How is what you\Nwe offer?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:53.35.0:59:55.62.Default..0.0.0..I took it as part\Nthan my share.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:57.12.0:59:58.50.Default..0.0.0..Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:58.60.1:00:00.08.Default..0.0.0..Your loyalty is not with us.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:00.19.1:00:01.40.Default..0.0.0..I do not this for pcs.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:02.74.1:00:05.58.Default..0.0.0..I know that the dwarves are very stubborn.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:06.23.1:00:07.61.Default..0.0.0..And very stubborn.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:08.12.1:00:11.37.Default..0.0.0..Tough.\Nsuspicious and reserved.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:11.48.1:00:13.78.Default..0.0.0..With the worst manners imaginable.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:13.93.1:00:15.40.Default..0.0.0..But they are also brave...
Dialogue: 0.1:00:15.74.1:00:20.02.Default..0.0.0.....\Nattentive and loyal to die.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:21.55.1:00:22.90.Default..0.0.0..I much endears them.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:23.01.1:00:24.41.Default..0.0.0..And if I can. I will save.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:25.73.1:00:28.82.Default..0.0.0..But Thorin. values this gem\Nabove.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:28.93.1:00:33.47.Default..0.0.0..A change back. I\Nseem to give you what you owe.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:33.58.1:00:35.45.Default..0.0.0..Will be no need for a war.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:41.10.1:00:42.86.Default..0.0.0..Rest tonight.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:42.98.1:00:44.39.Default..0.0.0..Must leave early.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:44.46.1:00:44.78.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.1:00:44.95.1:00:46.96.Default..0.0.0..Go as far away from here\Nyou can.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:47.04.1:00:48.15.Default..0.0.0..I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:48.27.1:00:51.67.Default..0.0.0..I named you the fourteenth. No\NI will leave the company now.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:51.74.1:00:52.47.Default..0.0.0..There is no company.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:52.58.1:00:53.58.Default..0.0.0..That's it.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:53.72.1:00:56.49.Default..0.0.0..I do not want to think what will\NThorin. when you see what you've done.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:56.60.1:00:57.98.Default..0.0.0..I'm not afraid to Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:58.05.1:00:59.81.Default..0.0.0..Well. you should.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:59.96.1:01:03.42.Default..0.0.0..Do not underestimate the evil of gold.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:03.56.1:01:10.69.Default..0.0.0..Oro in which a snake\Nhad...
Dialogue: 0.1:01:13.51.1:01:14.63.Default..0.0.0..At least...
Dialogue: 0.1:01:17.00.1:01:19.98.Default..0.0.0..Hey you. give him a bed\Nto this Hobbit.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:21.13.1:01:22.93.Default..0.0.0..Lots of hot food.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:24.73.1:01:25.54.Default..0.0.0..Is won.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:28.45.1:01:30.65.Default..0.0.0..Hey. Watch him well.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:32.03.1:01:34.72.Default..0.0.0..If you try to run away. let me know.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:37.56.1:01:38.63.Default..0.0.0..Walk.
Dialogue: 0.1:02:13.91.1:02:15.49.Default..0.0.0..Hobbit Wake up already.
Dialogue: 0.1:02:15.57.1:02:17.59.Default..0.0.0..Yaaaa. Esc...
Dialogue: 0.1:02:38.76.1:02:41.09.Default..0.0.0..'ll put the next\Nbetween your eyes.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:04.69.1:03:06.94.Default..0.0.0..Come to tell you.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:07.05.1:03:12.58.Default..0.0.0..Paying your debt has been offered and accepted\N.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:13.85.1:03:15.55.Default..0.0.0..What payment?
Dialogue: 0.1:03:15.69.1:03:17.73.Default..0.0.0..I did not give them anything.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:17.84.1:03:19.72.Default..0.0.0..They have nothing.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:26.41.1:03:28.06.Default..0.0.0..We have this.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:31.60.1:03:34.04.Default..0.0.0..Have stone ark.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:35.26.1:03:36.53.Default..0.0.0..Thieves.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:36.64.1:03:39.91.Default..0.0.0..How is having the relic thieves\Nof our people?
Dialogue: 0.1:03:40.03.1:03:42.68.Default..0.0.0..That stone belongs to the king.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:42.79.1:03:45.06.Default..0.0.0..And the king can have it.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:45.18.1:03:46.86.Default..0.0.0..With our...
Dialogue: 0.1:03:51.89.1:03:55.77.Default..0.0.0..But first\Nmust honor his word.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:58.47.1:04:00.63.Default..0.0.0..We believe naive.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:01.33.1:04:03.88.Default..0.0.0..It is a decoy.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:04.50.1:04:06.57.Default..0.0.0..A dirty lie.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:07.26.1:04:10.53.Default..0.0.0..The Ark Stone is on this mountain.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:10.64.1:04:12.37.Default..0.0.0..That's a trick.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:12.51.1:04:13.85.Default..0.0.0..Is not a trick.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:14.54.1:04:16.54.Default..0.0.0..The stone is real.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:17.91.1:04:19.34.Default..0.0.0..I gave them the stone.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:27.59.1:04:29.03.Default..0.0.0..You.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:30.21.1:04:33.23.Default..0.0.0..The thought me treasure.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:34.67.1:04:37.29.Default..0.0.0..You dared to steal.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:37.40.1:04:38.43.Default..0.0.0..Robarte. no.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:38.55.1:04:41.67.Default..0.0.0..Perhaps Call plunderer.\Nbut I consider myself honest.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:43.84.1:04:47.41.Default..0.0.0..I'm willing to give\Nwhere I belong.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:47.51.1:04:49.35.Default..0.0.0..Ceder what you share?
Dialogue: 0.1:04:50.55.1:04:53.07.Default..0.0.0..What you belong.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:53.98.1:04:57.44.Default..0.0.0..To you do not corrreponde my property\Nmiserable rat.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:59.29.1:05:01.05.Default..0.0.0..Had the intention to give it.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:02.14.1:05:03.65.Default..0.0.0..Many times I wanted to do. but.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:03.72.1:05:06.35.Default..0.0.0..But what thief?
Dialogue: 0.1:05:06.46.1:05:08.69.Default..0.0.0..You're different.\NThorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:08.90.1:05:11.38.Default..0.0.0..The dwarf was closed Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:11.49.1:05:13.07.Default..0.0.0..Never would have missed his word.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:13.43.1:05:16.81.Default..0.0.0..No\Nwould have doubted the loyalty of his people.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:16.93.1:05:21.85.Default..0.0.0..Do not you dare talk to me about loyalty.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:25.52.1:05:27.17.Default..0.0.0..Throw him from the wall.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:35.25.1:05:36.85.Default..0.0.0..Did not you hear?
Dialogue: 0.1:05:40.16.1:05:41.40.Default..0.0.0..I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:41.52.1:05:42.84.Default..0.0.0..Damn you.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:43.94.1:05:46.60.Default..0.0.0..It was Gandalf\Nyou put in this company.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:46.71.1:05:51.13.Default..0.0.0..If you like my plunderer.\Nplease do not hurt him.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:51.24.1:05:53.14.Default..0.0.0..Regrésamelo nothing more.
Dialogue: 0.1:05:56.74.1:05:59.86.Default..0.0.0..You do not seem very splendid figure...
Dialogue: 0.1:05:59.97.1:06:03.22.Default..0.0.0.....\Nking under the mountain. do you?
Dialogue: 0.1:06:03.47.1:06:06.56.Default..0.0.0..Thorin son of Thrain\N.
Dialogue: 0.1:06:13.00.1:06:15.70.Default..0.0.0..Never again will dealings with wizards.
Dialogue: 0.1:06:15.81.1:06:18.18.Default..0.0.0..- Do it.\N- O treacherous rats.
Dialogue: 0.1:06:22.83.1:06:24.88.Default..0.0.0..Will negotiation?
Dialogue: 0.1:06:25.03.1:06:28.55.Default..0.0.0..Return stone ark.\Nso we were promised?
Dialogue: 0.1:06:34.31.1:06:36.40.Default..0.0.0..Answer us now.
Dialogue: 0.1:06:37.52.1:06:39.59.Default..0.0.0..Do you choose peace?
Dialogue: 0.1:06:41.11.1:06:42.45.Default..0.0.0..O War?
Dialogue: 0.1:06:53.91.1:06:56.11.Default..0.0.0..Escojeré war.
Dialogue: 0.1:07:08.92.1:07:11.01.Default..0.0.0..Comes iron.
Dialogue: 0.1:07:17.48.1:07:18.70.Default..0.0.0..Devour anchors.
Dialogue: 0.1:07:37.71.1:07:38.76.Default..0.0.0..Who is he?
Dialogue: 0.1:07:39.56.1:07:40.81.Default..0.0.0..Do not incriminate me.
Dialogue: 0.1:07:40.92.1:07:44.05.Default..0.0.0..That's Dain. sir\NHills iron.
Dialogue: 0.1:07:44.16.1:07:45.87.Default..0.0.0..Primo de Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:07:45.98.1:07:46.88.Default..0.0.0..Are they equal?
Dialogue: 0.1:07:47.86.1:07:51.86.Default..0.0.0..Always considered to Thorin\Nthe most reasonable of 2.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:00.84.1:08:02.75.Default..0.0.0..Good morning.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:02.87.1:08:04.59.Default..0.0.0..How is everyone?
Dialogue: 0.1:08:07.47.1:08:11.09.Default..0.0.0..I have a little proposition if you do not mind...
Dialogue: 0.1:08:11.17.1:08:13.36.Default..0.0.0..... give me a few moments of your time.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:14.70.1:08:17.29.Default..0.0.0..They would consider...
Dialogue: 0.1:08:17.78.1:08:20.15.Default..0.0.0..... scoot once?
Dialogue: 0.1:08:21.67.1:08:24.02.Default..0.0.0..All pcs.\Nat this moment.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:24.14.1:08:25.29.Default..0.0.0..No retire.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:26.59.1:08:29.18.Default..0.0.0..Calma. Lord Dain.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:29.30.1:08:31.60.Default..0.0.0..Gandalf. The Grey.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:32.06.1:08:35.65.Default..0.0.0..Tomb Tell him go.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:35.76.1:08:38.02.Default..0.0.0..O I'll\Nirrigate the land with their blood.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:41.31.1:08:45.23.Default..0.0.0..No need for\Nwar between dwarves. men and elves.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:45.35.1:08:48.65.Default..0.0.0..The legion of orcs up in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:48.76.1:08:50.12.Default..0.0.0..Retains your men since.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:50.23.1:08:53.30.Default..0.0.0..No I will never withdraw\Nagainst an elf.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:53.41.1:08:57.16.Default..0.0.0..Will not be at that damn\Nforest spirit.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:57.27.1:09:00.76.Default..0.0.0..The desires nothing more than\Nbad for my people.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:01.44.1:09:05.50.Default..0.0.0..If you choose us\Nagainst me and my people.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:05.61.1:09:09.03.Default..0.0.0..I'll open her lovely head.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:09.14.1:09:11.29.Default..0.0.0..Have if still smiling as now.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:13.08.1:09:16.19.Default..0.0.0..As Thorin.\Nmust be crazy.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:16.30.1:09:17.41.Default..0.0.0..You hear all?
Dialogue: 0.1:09:17.52.1:09:19.11.Default..0.0.0..A fight.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:19.22.1:09:22.44.Default..0.0.0..Let's give those damn good beating.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:22.56.1:09:24.83.Default..0.0.0..Win.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:31.69.1:09:32.70.Default..0.0.0..Preparations.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:32.85.1:09:33.55.Default..0.0.0..Ready.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:42.03.1:09:43.79.Default..0.0.0..The cometierra.
Dialogue: 0.1:09:52.82.1:09:54.82.Default..0.0.0..Ahh. you can not be.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:07.69.1:10:12.72.Default..0.0.0..Forward. my armies!
Dialogue: 0.1:10:22.05.1:10:25.36.Default..0.0.0..The hordes of hell\Nthreaten us!
Dialogue: 0.1:10:25.47.1:10:26.44.Default..0.0.0..A fight.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:26.56.1:10:28.95.Default..0.0.0..A fight. children\NDurin.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:34.56.1:10:35.84.Default..0.0.0..'ll Save the wall.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:35.95.1:10:36.88.Default..0.0.0..Who's coming with me?
Dialogue: 0.1:10:36.99.1:10:38.30.Default..0.0.0..- Yo!\N- Let'S Go.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:38.38.1:10:39.64.Default..0.0.0..Still all.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:39.75.1:10:42.31.Default..0.0.0..Now. do not do anything\N?
Dialogue: 0.1:10:42.31.1:10:44.65.Default..0.0.0..I said. all quiet.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:49.11.1:10:52.01.Default..0.0.0..The elves are going to fight.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:55.14.1:10:57.84.Default..0.0.0..Thranduil is a\Nmadness. For.
Dialogue: 0.1:11:13.90.1:11:15.99.Default..0.0.0..Attack all.
Dialogue: 0.1:11:46.38.1:11:47.78.Default..0.0.0..Attack all.
Dialogue: 0.1:11:50.06.1:11:51.26.Default..0.0.0..Take this.
Dialogue: 0.1:11:53.10.1:11:56.13.Default..0.0.0..Gandalf. Is this a good\Nplace to be?
Dialogue: 0.1:11:56.24.1:11:58.82.Default..0.0.0..Send the warrior beasts!
Dialogue: 0.1:12:09.83.1:12:11.75.Default..0.0.0..Ready to attack.
Dialogue: 0.1:12:13.19.1:12:16.24.Default..0.0.0..They can not fight on two fronts...
Dialogue: 0.1:12:17.89.1:12:20.12.Default..0.0.0..Now we will make our move.
Dialogue: 0.1:12:21.20.1:12:24.20.Default..0.0.0..Attack all city!
Dialogue: 0.1:12:27.29.1:12:29.46.Default..0.0.0..Move on.
Dialogue: 0.1:12:38.77.1:12:40.32.Default..0.0.0..Azog.
Dialogue: 0.1:12:41.41.1:12:43.78.Default..0.0.0..Going to cut off the pace.
Dialogue: 0.1:12:48.15.1:12:49.73.Default..0.0.0..Move on everyone.
Dialogue: 0.1:12:49.81.1:12:51.39.Default..0.0.0..Return to Dáin...
Dialogue: 0.1:12:51.51.1:12:52.49.Default..0.0.0..Now.
Dialogue: 0.1:12:55.05.1:12:58.90.Default..0.0.0..A city.\NThis way.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:09.15.1:14:10.91.Default..0.0.0..Sigrid.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:22.50.1:14:25.12.Default..0.0.0..My children.\NWhere are my children?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:25.23.1:14:27.89.Default..0.0.0..I saw them.\NThey were in the old market.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:28.00.1:14:29.33.Default..0.0.0..Is the market?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:29.44.1:14:31.39.Default..0.0.0..And where are they now?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:31.46.1:14:32.59.Default..0.0.0..Tilda.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:32.69.1:14:33.81.Default..0.0.0..Sigrid.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:33.92.1:14:36.26.Default..0.0.0..The orcs are invading the driveway.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:37.00.1:14:39.31.Default..0.0.0..Take them to camp east.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:39.43.1:14:40.76.Default..0.0.0..Resitan as much as possible
Dialogue: 0.1:14:40.86.1:14:42.37.Default..0.0.0..archers here.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:42.49.1:14:45.58.Default..0.0.0..Orcs took the Stone Street.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:45.65.1:14:47.12.Default..0.0.0..The market is invaded.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:50.26.1:14:51.62.Default..0.0.0..Come this time
Dialogue: 0.1:14:51.70.1:14:53.15.Default..0.0.0..Follow me
Dialogue: 0.1:15:15.57.1:15:16.73.Default..0.0.0..Attack all
Dialogue: 0.1:15:16.84.1:15:19.56.Default..0.0.0..Al\Nattack until death!
Dialogue: 0.1:15:51.99.1:15:54.08.Default..0.0.0..Dad. This way.
Dialogue: 0.1:15:54.23.1:15:55.22.Default..0.0.0..This way.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:22.96.1:16:25.73.Default..0.0.0..Hey. Sigrid down.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:46.27.1:16:47.08.Default..0.0.0..Listen.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:47.64.1:16:49.93.Default..0.0.0..I who meet to women and children.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:49.93.1:16:52.41.Default..0.0.0..Take them to the great hall.\Nand obstruct the entrance.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:52.53.1:16:54.19.Default..0.0.0..Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0.1:16:55.20.1:16:57.28.Default..0.0.0..Ya should not leave for any reason.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:57.40.1:16:58.83.Default..0.0.0..I want to be with you.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:58.90.1:17:01.39.Default..0.0.0..Show him his father's respect.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:01.50.1:17:03.32.Default..0.0.0..Déjemelos my lord.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:03.50.1:17:06.03.Default..0.0.0..Have you heard?\NWe go to great room.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:06.14.1:17:06.89.Default..0.0.0..Alfrid.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:07.58.1:17:10.02.Default..0.0.0..Only women and children.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:10.13.1:17:12.00.Default..0.0.0..I need every man fighting.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:12.01.1:17:13.37.Default..0.0.0..Sure to return.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:13.45.1:17:15.19.Default..0.0.0..The Lord bring you safely.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:16.49.1:17:19.04.Default..0.0.0..My sword is available.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:21.10.1:17:22.69.Default..0.0.0..Look after them well.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:25.59.1:17:27.44.Default..0.0.0..Walk grandmother.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:38.96.1:17:41.19.Default..0.0.0..Go to the great hall.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:43.55.1:17:45.32.Default..0.0.0..Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:46.08.1:17:48.23.Default..0.0.0..Abandon...
Dialogue: 0.1:18:33.83.1:18:36.72.Default..0.0.0..can not store the city!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:37.20.1:18:41.02.Default..0.0.0..Dwarves almost no strength.
Dialogue: 0.1:18:47.77.1:18:50.27.Default..0.0.0..Unhappy Damned.
Dialogue: 0.1:19:03.15.1:19:04.66.Default..0.0.0..Where is Thorin?
Dialogue: 0.1:19:05.61.1:19:07.61.Default..0.0.0..I need.\NWhere is?
Dialogue: 0.1:19:12.04.1:19:15.32.Default..0.0.0..Let the blood run\Nin these lands!
Dialogue: 0.1:19:17.11.1:19:19.53.Default..0.0.0..Masácrenlos all.
Dialogue: 0.1:19:21.19.1:19:23.13.Default..0.0.0..All repliéguense.
Dialogue: 0.1:19:51.40.1:19:54.85.Default..0.0.0..Since when we abandon our people?
Dialogue: 0.1:19:54.97.1:19:58.79.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.\Nare dying out there.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:04.37.1:20:08.07.Default..0.0.0..There salons under the\Nmeeting this mountain.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:09.24.1:20:12.29.Default..0.0.0..Flats that can be fortified.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:13.52.1:20:15.07.Default..0.0.0..Strengthen. protect.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:15.18.1:20:16.16.Default..0.0.0..Yes
Dialogue: 0.1:20:18.90.1:20:19.38.Default..0.0.0..Yes.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:20.63.1:20:21.64.Default..0.0.0..That's it.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:22.58.1:20:25.25.Default..0.0.0..We must take the gold\Ndeeper. Safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:25.36.1:20:26.66.Default..0.0.0..I did not listen.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:26.66.1:20:28.55.Default..0.0.0..Frerin surrounded.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:28.65.1:20:30.23.Default..0.0.0..We massacred Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:33.08.1:20:34.81.Default..0.0.0..Many fall into war.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:35.52.1:20:37.63.Default..0.0.0..Life is worth.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:38.96.1:20:44.54.Default..0.0.0..But a treasure of this kind can not count on\Nlives lost.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:47.28.1:20:51.79.Default..0.0.0..This gold is worth every sacrifice\Nlives.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:52.87.1:20:58.49.Default..0.0.0..You sit here in these clubs\Nhalls with your crown on the forehead.
Dialogue: 0.1:20:58.54.1:21:02.45.Default..0.0.0..And yet these away\Nto be what you always were.
Dialogue: 0.1:21:03.65.1:21:06.20.Default..0.0.0..Do not ever talk to me.
Dialogue: 0.1:21:07.50.1:21:10.77.Default..0.0.0..Like a vulgar\Ndwarf anyone.
Dialogue: 0.1:21:11.86.1:21:15.69.Default..0.0.0..To make matters even...
Dialogue: 0.1:21:17.89.1:21:22.21.Default..0.0.0..... Thorin Oakenshield.
Dialogue: 0.1:21:23.53.1:21:25.49.Default..0.0.0..I am your king!
Dialogue: 0.1:21:25.60.1:21:27.08.Default..0.0.0..Always been my king.
Dialogue: 0.1:21:27.19.1:21:29.20.Default..0.0.0..Before you knew well. but...
Dialogue: 0.1:21:30.43.1:21:34.13.Default..0.0.0.....\NDo you realize what you've become?
Dialogue: 0.1:21:36.08.1:21:37.59.Default..0.0.0..Largo.
Dialogue: 0.1:21:40.80.1:21:41.67.Default..0.0.0..Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0.1:21:43.37.1:21:46.89.Default..0.0.0..Because I murder you.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:00.52.1:22:03.90.Default..0.0.0..You sit here with your crown.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:04.01.1:22:07.64.Default..0.0.0..These\Nfar from what you always were.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:07.76.1:22:09.84.Default..0.0.0..Treasure...
Dialogue: 0.1:22:09.96.1:22:11.76.Default..0.0.0..You can buy\Nlives lost.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:11.87.1:22:14.69.Default..0.0.0..That treasure produces a disorder.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:14.80.1:22:16.80.Default..0.0.0..By default the king of the mountains.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:16.87.1:22:18.10.Default..0.0.0..I am your king!
Dialogue: 0.1:22:18.21.1:22:20.49.Default..0.0.0..Wait. listen.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:20.59.1:22:22.71.Default..0.0.0..This is my gold...
Dialogue: 0.1:22:23.39.1:22:27.10.Default..0.0.0..... I never share.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:27.24.1:22:30.55.Default..0.0.0..This is all my goal. .
Dialogue: 0.1:22:30.55.1:22:32.33.Default..0.0.0..You want all your treasure.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:32.45.1:22:33.85.Default..0.0.0..Like a midget\Nanyone.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:35.31.1:22:37.27.Default..0.0.0..Coat of oak.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:37.38.1:22:39.74.Default..0.0.0..A disorder that went crazy\Nyour grandfather.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:39.85.1:22:42.01.Default..0.0.0..- Coat of oak.\N- He is Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:42.09.1:22:46.33.Default..0.0.0..Son of the king. son of Thrain
Dialogue: 0.1:22:46.33.1:22:48.40.Default..0.0.0..My grandfather.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:48.47.1:22:50.27.Default..0.0.0..Says that only produces a disorder.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:50.39.1:22:51.94.Default..0.0.0..They are dying out there.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:52.06.1:22:56.52.Default..0.0.0..Hey. is surrounded.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:56.59.1:22:58.10.Default..0.0.0..This surrounded.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:58.21.1:22:59.51.Default..0.0.0..This surrounded.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:59.62.1:23:01.56.Default..0.0.0..Retrieve your home.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:01.67.1:23:04.91.Default..0.0.0..'re Different Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:05.06.1:23:06.78.Default..0.0.0..I'm not like my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:06.93.1:23:10.36.Default..0.0.0..That really treasure worth more than your honor?
Dialogue: 0.1:23:10.46.1:23:12.12.Default..0.0.0..I'm not like my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:24.45.1:23:28.77.Default..0.0.0..This treasure will kill you.\Nno doubt.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:10.70.1:24:12.39.Default..0.0.0..Unfold
Dialogue: 0.1:24:12.50.1:24:15.15.Default..0.0.0..Unfold.\Nmountain.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:18.70.1:24:20.37.Default..0.0.0..Unfold.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:23.43.1:24:27.17.Default..0.0.0..Already reached its end.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:27.72.1:24:31.07.Default..0.0.0..Ready for the final attack.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:02.02.1:25:03.71.Default..0.0.0..I will not hide.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:03.82.1:25:07.29.Default..0.0.0..Behind a stone wall while others\Nfight our battles.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:07.40.1:25:08.30.Default..0.0.0..By us.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:12.10.1:25:14.62.Default..0.0.0..That is not in my veins\NThorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:19.17.1:25:22.29.Default..0.0.0..No. it is not.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:24.16.1:25:26.68.Default..0.0.0..Are children of Dorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:29.20.1:25:34.78.Default..0.0.0..And people Dorin.\Nnever runs away from a fight.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:57.74.1:25:59.77.Default..0.0.0..I have no right...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:59.77.1:26:02.11.Default..0.0.0..... to require this to none.
Dialogue: 0.1:26:06.55.1:26:08.58.Default..0.0.0..But last time.
Dialogue: 0.1:26:09.60.1:26:11.36.Default..0.0.0..I follow?
Dialogue: 0.1:26:22.18.1:26:24.80.Default..0.0.0..Al attack.
Dialogue: 0.1:26:29.54.1:26:33.50.Default..0.0.0..Not yet! Wait... wait...
Dialogue: 0.1:26:36.20.1:26:38.03.Default..0.0.0..Attack all... now!
Dialogue: 0.1:26:53.06.1:26:53.86.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:27:20.07.1:27:22.17.Default..0.0.0..On the clan!
Dialogue: 0.1:27:22.33.1:27:24.56.Default..0.0.0..For the honor!
Dialogue: 0.1:27:28.22.1:27:31.04.Default..0.0.0..For the honor.
Dialogue: 0.1:27:49.04.1:27:50.27.Default..0.0.0..Gandalf Dwarves.
Dialogue: 0.1:27:50.42.1:27:52.25.Default..0.0.0..They are fighting.
Dialogue: 0.1:27:55.25.1:27:57.33.Default..0.0.0..They are struggling with their king.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:01.36.1:28:03.56.Default..0.0.0..Any man who wants to offer his life.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:04.72.1:28:05.51.Default..0.0.0..Follow me!
Dialogue: 0.1:28:24.29.1:28:27.31.Default..0.0.0..We must support our\Nmen in life.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:27.42.1:28:28.60.Default..0.0.0..And in death.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:28.67.1:28:29.36.Default..0.0.0..I support you.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:29.46.1:28:30.55.Default..0.0.0..Grab your weapons.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:31.12.1:28:32.23.Default..0.0.0..Join us Adriana.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:32.30.1:28:35.11.Default..0.0.0..No. no. no.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:35.23.1:28:37.04.Default..0.0.0..I said let me.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:39.09.1:28:40.74.Default..0.0.0..Alfrid.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:40.85.1:28:42.21.Default..0.0.0..What a coward you are.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:42.32.1:28:43.12.Default..0.0.0..Coward?
Dialogue: 0.1:28:43.23.1:28:46.08.Default..0.0.0..Not every man has the courage to wear a corset.
Dialogue: 0.1:28:46.19.1:28:48.56.Default..0.0.0..You're not a man.\N're a rat.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:02.54.1:29:04.46.Default..0.0.0..Hey.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:05.29.1:29:06.15.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:16.74.1:29:18.81.Default..0.0.0..Hey...
Dialogue: 0.1:29:20.51.1:29:21.95.Default..0.0.0..What took so long?
Dialogue: 0.1:29:26.30.1:29:28.35.Default..0.0.0..There are too many unhappy Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:29.47.1:29:31.06.Default..0.0.0..Hope you already have a plan.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:32.22.1:29:33.14.Default..0.0.0..Yes.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:33.25.1:29:35.58.Default..0.0.0..There you go\Ndefeat their leader.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:36.52.1:29:37.57.Default..0.0.0..That!
Dialogue: 0.1:29:41.00.1:29:43.77.Default..0.0.0..'m Going to kill that piece of junk\N.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:43.88.1:29:45.68.Default..0.0.0..Come in.
Dialogue: 0.1:29:59.42.1:30:01.51.Default..0.0.0..Maybe survive.
Dialogue: 0.1:30:03.89.1:30:04.76.Default..0.0.0..Gandalf.
Dialogue: 0.1:30:12.59.1:30:13.41.Default..0.0.0..Is Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:30:14.21.1:30:20.33.Default..0.0.0..Y Fili. Kili. and Dwalin. It is\Ntaking their best warriors.
Dialogue: 0.1:30:20.44.1:30:21.65.Default..0.0.0..What for?
Dialogue: 0.1:30:21.74.1:30:24.69.Default..0.0.0..A cutting head of the serpent.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:06.78.1:31:07.62.Default..0.0.0..Gandalf.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:08.81.1:31:10.03.Default..0.0.0..Sir Legolas.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:10.61.1:31:12.48.Default..0.0.0..Is Legolas green leaf.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:13.06.1:31:14.24.Default..0.0.0..There is another army Gandalf.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:14.32.1:31:14.55.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.1:31:14.69.1:31:17.94.Default..0.0.0..A troop of Orcs are almost upon us.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:20.08.1:31:22.49.Default..0.0.0..That's his plan from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:23.82.1:31:28.92.Default..0.0.0..Azog facing our forces.\NThen Bolgo appears from the north.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:29.03.1:31:31.44.Default..0.0.0..North?\NAnd where is the north...
Dialogue: 0.1:31:31.54.1:31:33.45.Default..0.0.0..-... exactly?\N- Ravenhill.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:34.33.1:31:35.91.Default..0.0.0..Ravenhill.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:36.03.1:31:37.46.Default..0.0.0..But Thorin is there.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:37.57.1:31:39.67.Default..0.0.0..Y Fili and Kili. all there.
Dialogue: 0.1:31:56.44.1:31:57.72.Default..0.0.0..No. it is not.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:03.23.1:32:04.10.Default..0.0.0..It looks empty.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:05.55.1:32:07.28.Default..0.0.0..Think...
Dialogue: 0.1:32:08.25.1:32:10.12.Default..0.0.0..I do not think so.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:12.69.1:32:16.82.Default..0.0.0..Fili. take your brother.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:16.93.1:32:18.27.Default..0.0.0..Explore the towers.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:18.96.1:32:21.09.Default..0.0.0..Carefully\Nnot see.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:21.23.1:32:23.21.Default..0.0.0..If you see something wrong. let me know\N.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:23.32.1:32:24.65.Default..0.0.0..Do not attack.\NIs it clear?
Dialogue: 0.1:32:24.76.1:32:26.17.Default..0.0.0..We have company.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:26.28.1:32:28.08.Default..0.0.0..Trasgos mercenaries.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:28.19.1:32:30.60.Default..0.0.0..More than a hundred.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:30.71.1:32:32.40.Default..0.0.0..Here the stop.\NRun!
Dialogue: 0.1:32:32.51.1:32:33.53.Default..0.0.0..Come.
Dialogue: 0.1:32:35.32.1:32:36.74.Default..0.0.0..What do you expect?
Dialogue: 0.1:33:04.14.1:33:06.19.Default..0.0.0..Collect your company.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:12.70.1:33:15.80.Default..0.0.0..Lord. send this\NRivenhill group.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:15.91.1:33:17.68.Default..0.0.0..'re About to surprise\Ndwarves.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:17.80.1:33:18.86.Default..0.0.0..Thorin should know.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:19.01.1:33:20.23.Default..0.0.0..Then go to warn.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:20.34.1:33:24.63.Default..0.0.0..'ve Spilled enough blood elven\Ndefending this cursed land.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:24.70.1:33:25.60.Default..0.0.0..No more.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:25.71.1:33:27.00.Default..0.0.0..Thranduil.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:27.84.1:33:28.84.Default..0.0.0..I'll go.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:28.96.1:33:31.16.Default..0.0.0..Do not be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:31.27.1:33:32.74.Default..0.0.0..Never would you get.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:32.82.1:33:33.57.Default..0.0.0..Why not?
Dialogue: 0.1:33:33.68.1:33:37.10.Default..0.0.0..Because you would get\Nand end up with you.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:37.21.1:33:38.62.Default..0.0.0..They will not.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:40.27.1:33:41.79.Default..0.0.0..They will not see me.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:41.91.1:33:44.46.Default..0.0.0..Not in discussion.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:45.51.1:33:47.06.Default..0.0.0..I will not leave you.
Dialogue: 0.1:33:47.13.1:33:49.98.Default..0.0.0..I did not ask your permission\NGandalf.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:26.54.1:34:28.63.Default..0.0.0..Not go further.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:28.76.1:34:30.80.Default..0.0.0..You will not leave this place.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:30.88.1:34:32.83.Default..0.0.0..Not this time.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:32.94.1:34:35.06.Default..0.0.0..Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:35.17.1:34:37.18.Default..0.0.0..Dwarves be massacred.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:37.25.1:34:39.63.Default..0.0.0..Yes. they will kill.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:39.71.1:34:47.19.Default..0.0.0..Today. tomorrow. in a year. or even perhaps\N100.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:47.30.1:34:48.45.Default..0.0.0..That matters.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:48.57.1:34:50.61.Default..0.0.0..They are mortal.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:52.34.1:34:55.58.Default..0.0.0..Think your life is worth more than yours\N.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:55.65.1:34:58.09.Default..0.0.0..Although no\Nlove it.
Dialogue: 0.1:34:58.17.1:35:02.02.Default..0.0.0..Nothing\Nlove inside you.
Dialogue: 0.1:35:08.03.1:35:09.64.Default..0.0.0..What do you know about love?
Dialogue: 0.1:35:09.75.1:35:10.95.Default..0.0.0..None.
Dialogue: 0.1:35:11.02.1:35:14.99.Default..0.0.0..What you feel for the dwarf is not real.
Dialogue: 0.1:35:16.28.1:35:18.52.Default..0.0.0..Do you think it is love?
Dialogue: 0.1:35:19.68.1:35:21.63.Default..0.0.0..Are you willing to die for him?
Dialogue: 0.1:35:24.59.1:35:26.56.Default..0.0.0..If you hurt her...
Dialogue: 0.1:35:26.68.1:35:28.76.Default..0.0.0..... you'll have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0.1:35:34.74.1:35:36.36.Default..0.0.0..I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0.1:35:59.23.1:36:00.38.Default..0.0.0..Top.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:00.49.1:36:02.36.Default..0.0.0..Away from me.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:02.48.1:36:04.10.Default..0.0.0..Do not take orders from you.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:04.17.1:36:06.41.Default..0.0.0..People confided in you. We heeded.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:06.48.1:36:09.50.Default..0.0.0..The post of governor.\Nwas there for you.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:10.36.1:36:12.43.Default..0.0.0..And you blew it away.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:13.19.1:36:14.16.Default..0.0.0..Why?
Dialogue: 0.1:36:23.12.1:36:24.45.Default..0.0.0..Alfrid.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:24.63.1:36:26.14.Default..0.0.0..You look the rear.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:39.95.1:36:42.33.Default..0.0.0..Hey. stay\Nhere.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:42.41.1:36:44.28.Default..0.0.0..Join the higher levels.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:44.39.1:36:46.44.Default..0.0.0..I'll take care.
Dialogue: 0.1:36:55.65.1:36:57.52.Default..0.0.0..Where is this ugly orc?
Dialogue: 0.1:36:59.03.1:37:01.08.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:01.54.1:37:02.66.Default..0.0.0..Bilbo.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:02.80.1:37:04.89.Default..0.0.0..Have to leave.\Nnow.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:04.99.1:37:07.26.Default..0.0.0..Azog have men\Nattacking from the north.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:07.34.1:37:09.17.Default..0.0.0..This tower is completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:09.28.1:37:09.91.Default..0.0.0..There will be no output.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:10.02.1:37:12.60.Default..0.0.0..Being so close. that damn\Norc is there.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:12.71.1:37:14.02.Default..0.0.0..- You should go for it.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:14.13.1:37:15.86.Default..0.0.0..That's what you want.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:15.97.1:37:17.78.Default..0.0.0..Wants to draw us there.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:19.38.1:37:21.40.Default..0.0.0..'s A trap.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:37.03.1:37:39.19.Default..0.0.0..Fili and Kili Search for\Ntell them to return.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:39.30.1:37:40.72.Default..0.0.0..Thorin. are you sure this\N?
Dialogue: 0.1:37:40.83.1:37:41.48.Default..0.0.0..Do it.
Dialogue: 0.1:37:43.92.1:37:45.65.Default..0.0.0..We will live to fight another day.
Dialogue: 0.1:38:08.00.1:38:08.52.Default..0.0.0..Oh. no.
Dialogue: 0.1:38:08.99.1:38:11.26.Default..0.0.0..This die first.
Dialogue: 0.1:38:11.37.1:38:14.50.Default..0.0.0..Then the brother.
Dialogue: 0.1:38:14.58.1:38:18.46.Default..0.0.0..Then you. Coat of oak.
Dialogue: 0.1:38:18.57.1:38:21.59.Default..0.0.0..You will die last.
Dialogue: 0.1:38:33.81.1:38:36.83.Default..0.0.0..Here ends your dirty lineage!
Dialogue: 0.1:38:57.54.1:38:58.93.Default..0.0.0..Him Fight.
Dialogue: 0.1:38:59.85.1:39:00.80.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:39:02.90.1:39:04.87.Default..0.0.0..Thorin. no.
Dialogue: 0.1:40:23.58.1:40:24.51.Default..0.0.0..Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0.1:40:28.10.1:40:29.40.Default..0.0.0..Now.
Dialogue: 0.1:40:46.08.1:40:47.20.Default..0.0.0..Kili.
Dialogue: 0.1:42:18.39.1:42:20.47.Default..0.0.0..Kill him!
Dialogue: 0.1:42:25.63.1:42:27.05.Default..0.0.0..Just finish it!
Dialogue: 0.1:42:41.97.1:42:42.88.Default..0.0.0..Stay away.
Dialogue: 0.1:42:47.76.1:42:48.31.Default..0.0.0..Kili.
Dialogue: 0.1:42:48.42.1:42:49.69.Default..0.0.0..Oh...
Dialogue: 0.1:42:53.55.1:42:54.46.Default..0.0.0..Kili.
Dialogue: 0.1:42:54.60.1:42:56.12.Default..0.0.0..Tauriel.
Dialogue: 0.1:42:56.87.1:42:58.20.Default..0.0.0..Kili.
Dialogue: 0.1:46:50.73.1:46:51.82.Default..0.0.0..Fight.
Dialogue: 0.1:49:29.30.1:49:30.46.Default..0.0.0..Tauriel.
Dialogue: 0.1:54:11.75.1:54:14.02.Default..0.0.0..The Eagles are coming.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:04.05.1:55:06.84.Default..0.0.0..- Bilbo. - Do not move. do not move\N. Quiet.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:11.53.1:55:13.02.Default..0.0.0..Glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:15.33.1:55:18.14.Default..0.0.0..I want from knowing that I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:18.28.1:55:20.44.Default..0.0.0..'re Not going to any part Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:20.55.1:55:22.17.Default..0.0.0..Gotta live.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:22.28.1:55:26.24.Default..0.0.0..I want to withdraw my words and my actions beyond\N.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:27.59.1:55:29.91.Default..0.0.0..You did what a true friend would.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:31.04.1:55:32.94.Default..0.0.0..Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:35.03.1:55:38.08.Default..0.0.0..Blindness not let me understand.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:39.35.1:55:42.13.Default..0.0.0..'m So sorry.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:42.24.1:55:44.83.Default..0.0.0..I made you run so many dangers.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:44.94.1:55:48.79.Default..0.0.0..No. I'm glad to have shared these dangers\NThorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:48.91.1:55:50.42.Default..0.0.0..I never go to complain.
Dialogue: 0.1:55:52.59.1:55:56.55.Default..0.0.0..Is much more than any\NBaggins deserves.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:00.87.1:56:02.96.Default..0.0.0..Farewell.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:03.07.1:56:04.79.Default..0.0.0..Mr. Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:06.13.1:56:08.11.Default..0.0.0..Move your books.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:08.25.1:56:11.78.Default..0.0.0..In your pretty rocking.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:11.92.1:56:14.77.Default..0.0.0..Plant your trees.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:15.15.1:56:18.03.Default..0.0.0..And let them grow.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:21.77.1:56:28.64.Default..0.0.0..If there are more people who might be on\Ngold.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:30.05.1:56:33.89.Default..0.0.0..The world would be a happier place\N.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:36.93.1:56:42.08.Default..0.0.0..No. no. no. no. no. no.\NThorin Thorin not you dare.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:51.33.1:56:55.75.Default..0.0.0..Thorin Thorin resists.\NResists please.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:55.90.1:56:58.68.Default..0.0.0..Eagles. The eagles.
Dialogue: 0.1:56:58.79.1:57:00.33.Default..0.0.0..Eagles arrived.
Dialogue: 0.1:57:00.44.1:57:01.88.Default..0.0.0..Thorin.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:02.52.1:58:05.55.Default..0.0.0..Now. I do not ever come back.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:06.51.1:58:08.29.Default..0.0.0..Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0.1:58:09.13.1:58:10.75.Default..0.0.0..Not yet.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:12.07.1:58:16.47.Default..0.0.0..In the north. looking for\NDúnedain.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:17.54.1:58:20.78.Default..0.0.0..Among them is a young officer\N. Talk to him.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:22.05.1:58:25.07.Default..0.0.0..His father Arathorn was a good man.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:25.23.1:58:30.18.Default..0.0.0..His son. could reach\Nbe one great.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:32.35.1:58:34.04.Default..0.0.0..How is it called?
Dialogue: 0.1:58:34.37.1:58:37.24.Default..0.0.0..In wilderness tell Strider.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:37.39.1:58:42.82.Default..0.0.0..Y\Nyou have to discover on your own name.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:45.79.1:58:47.73.Default..0.0.0..Legolas.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:48.92.1:58:51.08.Default..0.0.0..Your mother loved her son.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:52.85.1:58:54.97.Default..0.0.0..More than anyone.
Dialogue: 0.1:58:55.08.1:58:57.31.Default..0.0.0..More than life.
Dialogue: 0.1:59:32.57.1:59:35.19.Default..0.0.0..Wish burial.
Dialogue: 0.1:59:36.28.1:59:38.37.Default..0.0.0..Yes
Dialogue: 0.1:59:39.41.1:59:42.79.Default..0.0.0..If this is love.\NI do not want to have.
Dialogue: 0.1:59:46.14.1:59:47.69.Default..0.0.0..Aléjalo me.
Dialogue: 0.1:59:48.20.1:59:49.57.Default..0.0.0..Can you?
Dialogue: 0.1:59:54.46.1:59:58.41.Default..0.0.0..Why\Npain is so strong?
Dialogue: 0.1:59:58.99.2:00:01.11.Default..0.0.0..Because it was real.
Dialogue: 0.2:02:45.74.2:02:48.24.Default..0.0.0..There will be a banquet tonight.
Dialogue: 0.2:02:48.34.2:02:50.14.Default..0.0.0..Songs were sung.
Dialogue: 0.2:02:50.26.2:02:52.27.Default..0.0.0..Histories were counted.
Dialogue: 0.2:02:53.50.2:02:58.53.Default..0.0.0..And Thorin Oakenshield.\Nbecome legend.
Dialogue: 0.2:02:59.69.2:03:02.10.Default..0.0.0..Balin. is that this is how\Nmust honor.
Dialogue: 0.2:03:02.21.2:03:03.73.Default..0.0.0..But for me.\Nnever was so.
Dialogue: 0.2:03:04.75.2:03:11.72.Default..0.0.0..He was... for me...\Néra...
Dialogue: 0.2:03:18.34.2:03:22.44.Default..0.0.0..I think I'll go quietly.\NI despidirías of others.
Dialogue: 0.2:03:22.55.2:03:24.13.Default..0.0.0..Say goodbye in person.
Dialogue: 0.2:03:39.93.2:03:43.25.Default..0.0.0..If any of you.\Npasses by Bag End.
Dialogue: 0.2:03:48.41.2:03:50.64.Default..0.0.0..Tea is at 4pm.
Dialogue: 0.2:03:51.56.2:03:54.07.Default..0.0.0..There's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0.2:03:55.80.2:03:57.95.Default..0.0.0..Y are always welcome.
Dialogue: 0.2:04:03.52.2:04:04.45.Default..0.0.0..Ahh...
Dialogue: 0.2:04:05.00.2:04:08.07.Default..0.0.0..Do not bother playing.
Dialogue: 0.2:04:51.16.2:04:53.50.Default..0.0.0..The boundary of the region.
Dialogue: 0.2:04:54.18.2:04:56.34.Default..0.0.0..I here say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0.2:04:58.57.2:05:00.58.Default..0.0.0..'s A shame.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:02.53.2:05:06.59.Default..0.0.0..I liked having a magician close.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:08.00.2:05:09.80.Default..0.0.0..I think it brings me luck.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:10.67.2:05:13.83.Default..0.0.0..Really do not incur all your adventures...
Dialogue: 0.2:05:13.90.2:05:16.64.Default..0.0.0..... and escapes were accomplished\Nby sheer luck.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:17.03.2:05:21.09.Default..0.0.0..The magic rings should not be used lightly\NBilbo.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:21.20.2:05:22.48.Default..0.0.0..Do not take me for a fool.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:22.59.2:05:25.52.Default..0.0.0..Is to find one in the tunnels of the goblins.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:25.63.2:05:28.48.Default..0.0.0..And you is keeping\Nsince.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:31.57.2:05:33.62.Default..0.0.0..Well. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:38.08.2:05:39.93.Default..0.0.0..Until then Gandalf.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:42.27.2:05:44.39.Default..0.0.0..Bye now.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:51.01.2:05:54.22.Default..0.0.0..And... do not worry\Nfor the ring.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:54.30.2:05:56.49.Default..0.0.0..Fell out of my pocket\Nin battle.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:56.76.2:05:57.64.Default..0.0.0..I lost.
Dialogue: 0.2:05:58.56.2:06:01.69.Default..0.0.0..Is a very fine person\NMr. Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.2:06:02.62.2:06:05.17.Default..0.0.0..And I have you fondly.
Dialogue: 0.2:06:06.52.2:06:13.24.Default..0.0.0..But you're just a little guy.\Nin a vast world after all.
Dialogue: 0.2:06:44.39.2:06:46.97.Default..0.0.0..That's the hood of my mother.
Dialogue: 0.2:06:47.08.2:06:50.46.Default..0.0.0..And that. my chair...
Dialogue: 0.2:06:50.57.2:06:53.51.Default..0.0.0..Mmm. is the\Nstool ground.
Dialogue: 0.2:06:53.66.2:06:54.81.Default..0.0.0..What is happening?
Dialogue: 0.2:06:55.35.2:06:57.23.Default..0.0.0..What Mr. Bilbo?
Dialogue: 0.2:06:57.34.2:06:59.76.Default..0.0.0..You should not be here.
Dialogue: 0.2:06:59.90.2:07:00.88.Default..0.0.0..What is this?
Dialogue: 0.2:07:01.02.2:07:04.19.Default..0.0.0..Since\Nwas given up for dead. of course.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:04.31.2:07:05.49.Default..0.0.0..I have not yet dead.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:05.60.2:07:07.65.Default..0.0.0..I do not mind not believe it.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:08.34.2:07:11.22.Default..0.0.0..I do not think this is\Nallowed.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:11.33.2:07:12.35.Default..0.0.0..Mr. Bilbo.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:13.28.2:07:15.78.Default..0.0.0..20. Someone offers 21?
Dialogue: 0.2:07:15.92.2:07:17.31.Default..0.0.0..Does anyone offers 21?
Dialogue: 0.2:07:17.42.2:07:18.47.Default..0.0.0..PROPERTY IS SOLD THE LATE MR. Bilbo Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:18.59.2:07:20.44.Default..0.0.0..Sold to Ms. Walker..
Dialogue: 0.2:07:20.55.2:07:22.81.Default..0.0.0..This asking... feet.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:24.25.2:07:28.64.Default..0.0.0..This craft is made in the county.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:28.75.2:07:30.91.Default..0.0.0..False imitations Nothing here.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:31.02.2:07:32.15.Default..0.0.0..Alto.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:32.30.2:07:33.20.Default..0.0.0..Alto.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:33.31.2:07:34.34.Default..0.0.0..A overalls.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:34.44.2:07:35.47.Default..0.0.0..Who is you.?
Dialogue: 0.2:07:35.61.2:07:36.97.Default..0.0.0..What like what?
Dialogue: 0.2:07:37.08.2:07:40.54.Default..0.0.0..Know exactly who I am. Lobby Sackville Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:40.91.2:07:42.83.Default..0.0.0..This is my home. my home\N.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:42.91.2:07:44.85.Default..0.0.0..These are my silverware.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:44.93.2:07:45.39.Default..0.0.0..How kind.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:45.50.2:07:46.57.Default..0.0.0..This is very irregular
Dialogue: 0.2:07:46.68.2:07:50.28.Default..0.0.0..been over 13 months since the disappearance\N.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:50.73.2:07:55.54.Default..0.0.0..If ud. Bilbo Baggins\Nreally is. and is not dead.
Dialogue: 0.2:07:55.64.2:07:57.73.Default..0.0.0..What you can try?
Dialogue: 0.2:07:57.84.2:07:58.40.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.2:07:58.51.2:08:02.03.Default..0.0.0..Well. something\Nofficer his name will suffice.
Dialogue: 0.2:08:02.14.2:08:04.24.Default..0.0.0..Sure. of course.
Dialogue: 0.2:08:05.99.2:08:09.15.Default..0.0.0..A contract of employment or...
Dialogue: 0.2:08:12.03.2:08:13.01.Default..0.0.0..No matter what.
Dialogue: 0.2:08:14.28.2:08:16.04.Default..0.0.0..Look. my signature.
Dialogue: 0.2:08:18.21.2:08:20.80.Default..0.0.0..Hey\Ncertainly seems to be in order.
Dialogue: 0.2:08:20.87.2:08:23.65.Default..0.0.0..Yes There can be no doubt.
Dialogue: 0.2:08:23.76.2:08:27.30.Default..0.0.0..Who is that person\Nto which presto service?
Dialogue: 0.2:08:28.45.2:08:31.04.Default..0.0.0..Thorin Oakenshield.
Dialogue: 0.2:08:33.09.2:08:37.43.Default..0.0.0..He was my friend.
Dialogue: 0.2:10:32.21.2:10:33.59.Default..0.0.0..No thanks.
Dialogue: 0.2:10:33.70.2:10:38.51.Default..0.0.0..I do not want more visits. congratulations\Nor distant relatives.
Dialogue: 0.2:10:38.61.2:10:41.80.Default..0.0.0..And what about\Nold friends?
Dialogue: 0.2:10:49.59.2:10:52.47.Default..0.0.0..- Gandalf?\N- Bilbo Baggins.
Dialogue: 0.2:10:52.59.2:10:54.95.Default..0.0.0..My dear Gandalf.
Dialogue: 0.2:10:55.06.2:10:59.76.Default..0.0.0..113 years old.\NWho would believe it?
